(27, 148, 19, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">Respected Sir/Madam,</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">We wish to congratulate </span><strong>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society, Raipur </strong><span class=\"xsize\">for <strong>floating Expression of Interest (EoI) for Selection of Agency for Establishment and Running of Programme Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation Trust (DMFT), Korba District</strong>.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">We are pleased to bring to your kind notice that <strong>Nangia &amp; Co LLP</strong> is providing professional services to a varied array of clients ranging from Government departments, banks, PSUs, private business houses, etc. We provide a wide gamut of services in the consulting space which range from </span><span class=\"xcolour\"><strong><em><span style=\"color: #c00000;\">Government Advisory,&nbsp;Project Management Consultancy, Skill Development &amp; Capacity Building, Impact Assessment, Monitoring &amp; Evaluation, Technology Consulting, , Due Diligence,&nbsp;, Agri &amp; Food Processing, MSME Development, Cluster Development, enterprise Creation, Livelihood Promotion, IT Advisory, E-governance, Infrastructure Augmentation, Entry Level Strategy, Legal, Taxation, GST, Assurance, Mergers and Acquisitions, etc</span></em></strong></span><span class=\"xsize\">. Please refer our website <a href=\"http://www.nangia.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.nangia.com</a> <a href=\"http://www.nangia-andersen.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">f</a>or more details.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">As a firm with significant relevant experience, we are keen to participate in this prestigious assignment. However, upon reviewing the RFP, we believe that certain eligibility and evaluation criteria require clarification from your kind department to encourage broader competition and participation from other experienced consulting firms.&nbsp; Kindly provide the clarification for the prebid queries attached herewith.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span class=\"xsize\">Best Regards</span></p>', 'uploads/message_files/DKhPf7xevnGPxTbrPP7P998MQ8bAcQDuijjMMppo.docx', '2026-05-19 10:58:38', 1, 0, NULL, '7', NULL),
(28, 144, 13, '<p>Respected Sir / Ma\'am,</p>\r\n<p>Greetings from Grant Thornton Bharat LLP.</p>\r\n<p>We refer to&nbsp;<strong>Procurement Number: <span data-teams=\"true\">EoI/CSF/PMU/BIODIVERISTY/2026</span></strong> titled<strong> \"<span data-teams=\"true\">Expression of Interest (EoI) for Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Wetland and Biodiversity Conservation Works</span>&rdquo;</strong>&nbsp; We sincerely appreciate the opportunity to participate in this assignment.</p>\r\n<p>We would like to kindly request an extension of Two (2) weeks for the submission deadline of the proposal. This request is due to the need for additional time to finalize key technical inputs, complete internal reviews, and ensure alignment with the requirements outlined in the solicitation.</p>\r\n<p>We are committed to submitting a comprehensive and high-quality proposal, and the requested extension will greatly support us in strengthening our submission.</p>\r\n<p>We request your kind consideration of this extension and would be grateful for your confirmation at the earliest convenience.</p>\r\n<p>Thank you for your understanding and support.</p>\r\n<p>Warm Regards,</p>\r\n<p>Grant Thornton Bharat LLP.</p>', '', '2026-05-29 12:20:25', 1, 0, NULL, '2', NULL),
(29, 144, 16, '<p><strong>To</strong><br><strong>The CEO</strong><br><strong>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)</strong><br>State Data Centre Building,<br>Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; 492001<br><br>Subject: Request for Extension of Submission Date for Expression of Interest (EoI) PMU for Wetland<br>and Biodiversity Conservation Works<br><br>Reference: <strong>EoI No. EoI/CSF/PMU/BIODIVERISTY/2026 dated 12.05.2026</strong><br><br>Respected Sir,<br>We sincerely thank you for providing us with the opportunity to participate in the Expression of<br>Interest for the establishment of a Project Management Unit (PMU) for Wetland and Biodiversity<br>Conservation Works under the Chhattisgarh State Biodiversity Board.<br>We are keen to contribute meaningfully to this important initiative and aim to submit a comprehensive<br>proposal with highly qualified resources and domain expertise. However, considering the scope and<br>importance of the assignment, we request your kind consideration for an extension of two (2) weeks<br>in the submission deadline. This additional time will enable us to prepare a more detailed and quality<br>submission aligned with your expectations.<br>We humbly request you to grant the extension and support our participation in this initiative.<br>We shall be grateful for your consideration and look forward to your positive response.<br><br>Yours faithfully<br><strong>Prabal Bhardwaj</strong><br><strong>Director, KPMG</strong></p>', 'uploads/message_files/XYHJ4rvEkpnvhIyoPyp0XTk3IPSgkawvofAIs0nW.pdf', '2026-05-29 15:11:27', 1, 0, NULL, '4', NULL),
(30, 144, 1, '<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"211\">Your request for extension of the submission deadline has been forwarded to the concerned department for consideration. Any decision in this regard shall be communicated in due course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"249\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Regards,<br data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"224\">Empanelment Team<br data-start=\"240\" data-end=\"243\">CHiPS.</p>', '', '2026-06-01 17:30:28', 1, 0, NULL, '2,4', NULL),
(31, 162, 16, '<p>To,<br><strong>The CEO</strong><br><strong>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)</strong><br>State Data Centre Building,<br>Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; 492001<br><br>Subject: Request for Extension of Submission Date for Expression of Interest (EoI) PMU for<br>Enforcement and Implementation of various waste management rules in Chhattisgarh<br><br>Reference: EoI/CHiPS/PMU/CECB/WMR/2026 dated 19.05.2026<br><br>Respected Sir,<br>We sincerely thank you for providing us with the opportunity to participate in the Expression of<br>Interest for the establishment of a Project Management Unit (PMU) for Enforcement and<br>Implementation of various waste management rules in Chhattisgarh.<br>We are keen to contribute meaningfully to this important initiative and aim to submit a<br>comprehensive proposal with highly qualified resources and domain expertise. However,<br>considering the scope and importance of the assignment, we request your kind consideration for<br>an extension of one (1) week in the submission deadline. This additional time will enable us to<br>prepare a more detailed and quality submission aligned with your expectations.<br><br>We humbly request you to grant the extension and support our participation in this initiative.<br><br>We shall be grateful for your consideration and look forward to your positive response.<br>Additionally, we have also submitted a request on the CHiPS portal for date extension.<br><br>Yours faithfully,<br><strong>Tarun Rajvanshi</strong><br><strong>Associate Director, KPMG, G&amp;PS-HHSS</strong><br>Date: 03 June 2026<br>Place: Delhi</p>', 'uploads/message_files/VNDrwWqnicfIzinm4KjUhWVhhHuKyyTm62yN0gwh.pdf', '2026-06-03 15:28:23', 1, 0, NULL, '4', NULL),
(32, 162, 17, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Dear Sir/ Madam,</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">This is regarding the captioned EoI (Ref no. - EoI/CHiPS/PMU/CECB/WMR/2026) published on 19<sup>th</sup> May 2026. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">Considering that the response to the pre-bid queries was published on 3<sup>rd</sup> June 2026, we request an extension of the submission deadline by at least 10 days, i.e., <strong>19<sup>th</sup> June 2026.</strong> This additional time would enable us to prepare and submit a comprehensive proposal. Please find attached our letter seeking for extension. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">We remain keen to participate in this opportunity and are looking forward to a positive response. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks &amp; Regards,</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Edwin James</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Verdana\',sans-serif; color: #002060; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Associate Director</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\"> </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Verdana\',sans-serif; color: #002060; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">| Technology &amp; Transformation </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Verdana\',sans-serif; color: #002060; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Deloitte Touche Tohmatsu India LLP </span></strong></p>', 'uploads/message_files/5uo1eopBoTxzqO9fvfffstEDOUC4HWkTHJxIAueM.pdf', '2026-06-05 21:42:59', 1, 0, NULL, '5', NULL),
(33, 162, 1, '<p>Your request for extension of the submission deadline has been forwarded to the concerned department for consideration. Any decision in this regard shall be communicated in due course.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"213\" data-end=\"249\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Regards,<br data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"224\">Empanelment Team</p>', '', '2026-06-08 10:40:53', 1, 0, NULL, '4,5', NULL),
