(37, 176, 13, '<p>To</p>\r\n<p>The Chief Executive Officer (CEO)</p>\r\n<p>Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)</p>\r\n<p>State Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room</p>\r\n<p>Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh &ndash; 492001</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>Dear Sir,</p>\r\n<p>Greetings from Grant Thornton Bharat LLP.</p>\r\n<p>We thank CHiPS/CGRDC for inviting proposals under the subject EoI. After a detailed review of the EoI document, we request clarification on the attached points to enable a better understanding of the scope, effort estimation, and deployment requirements.</p>\r\n<p>Kind Regards,</p>\r\n<p>Grant Thornton Bharat LLP</p>', 'uploads/message_files/STu3Uj2wJlbUWv96wV2UkHWvOLLPJDnBGGqEhQXb.pdf', '2026-07-20 18:32:03', 0, 0, NULL, '2', NULL),
