ass=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 22.8pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of the Project</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Quality of proposed methodology for such specific kind of a project</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Prior exposure to implementing government projects in Bid Management and Exit Management</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of key SLAs for the project management</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 47.92%; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid black 1.0pt; border-right: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid black .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; padding: 0in 0in 0in 0in; height: 21.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47%\">\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Suitability of profile</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Years of relevant experience</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Good understanding of project management best practices framework</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ability<span style=\"mso-tab-count: 1;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>to Negotiate/Persuade/Influence</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong ability to understand and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</p>\r\n<p class=\"TableParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -.25in; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: .05pt 0in .0001pt 22.8pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Excellent communication abilities</p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions and implications.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt;\">The last date for submission of response is 24/02/2026, 05:00 PM. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 11.95pt 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Thepreferredmodeofcommunicationforqueryresolutionisthroughemailto:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">CEO, CHiPS, State Data Centre, Civil Lines,Raipur 492001 </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:Empl.chips@cgchips.in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">Empl.chips@cgchips.in</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; letter-spacing: .25pt;\">, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><a href=\"mailto:ceochips@nic.in\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; color: blue; letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">ceochips@nic.in</span></a><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">, </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; line-height: 115%; margin: 0in 45.0pt .0001pt 33.6pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%;\">Tel:+91-771-4014158;Fax:+91771-<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">4014158</span></span></p>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EoI</li>\r\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</span></li>\r\n<li>R<span style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">esumes of resources that will face the interview.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '555555', '2026-02-03 16:53:45', 4, 1, '2026-02-03 16:42:42', 83, '2026-02-03 16:53:45', NULL, '2026-02-03 23:10:56', 1, NULL, 0, 1, '2026-02-03', NULL, 'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)', 'Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU) for District Mineral Foundation Trust (DMFT), Baloda Bazar- Bhatapara District', '2026-02-03', '2026-02-10 17:00:00', '2026-02-24 17:00:00', '2026-02-25 17:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in', '2026-09-16', 0, 1, 0, 'uploads/authorizationletters/P1pKjHAEn0xY33abcEPClBsgmAneUxOFBybZsI6z.pdf', NULL, 0, 2, 1, 1, '7,8', 0, 0, 1, NULL, '', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 3281505.27, 0, 0, 590670.95, 3872176.22, 1, 0, NULL, NULL);
