indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">The setup of SOP shall include preparation of comprehensive set of standard documents and forms that can be used. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority to Develop knowledge content, brochures, digital campaigns, and audio-visual materials to promote Sirpur&rsquo;s heritage, culture, and investment potential.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.2.3<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Fund</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\"> </span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Management</span></strong><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assistance to Authority in managing its funds efficiently, allocation in various projects, raising funds from various sources like loans, bonds, etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.2.4<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Assistance in drafting of Rules/Regulations<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Benchmarking of SSADA&rsquo;s disposal rules and development regulations with other development Authorities in India.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Suggest and Assist Authority in modifications of such rules/regulations on the basis of benchmarking.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 49.65pt; line-height: 111%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Other relevant activities as assigned by the Authority from time to time.</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 21.3pt; line-height: 111%;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Note: </span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">The following services are not part of<strong> </strong>the consultant&rsquo;s scope of work:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 90.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Preparation of any statutory documents, legal opinions, or assistance in legal proceedings.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 90.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 90.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-GB;\">Undertaking any physical construction or infrastructure development work. </span></p>', NULL, '<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 52.4465%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.9562%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; Milestone</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0438%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; Payment</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 57.9562%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Submission of Monthly Progress Report </span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 42.0438%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: medium;\">&nbsp; Monthly Basis</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', NULL, '<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">An Evaluation Committee formed by the SSADA/CHiPS, whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">A brief presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their past experience if any in similar area of expertise.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Post presentation by the consultants, the proposed team members will be interviewed by the Evaluation Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follow:<br><br>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.60458%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>S.no.</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.28729%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Evaluation Criteria</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.2188%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Detail description</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.96829%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp;Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.60458%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">1</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.28729%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Bidder Experience</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.2188%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;Relevant experience of the firm:</span></p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Consulting Experience of minimum 5 (five) projects as PMU in Tourism Sector for preparation of vision document, policy formulation, feasibility study, business plan preparation or transaction advisory with Central Government or State Governments or their agencies in last 10 years. The duration of PMU assignment shall not be less than 1 (one) year, and the consultancy fee of such project should be at least INR 2 Crore.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">In last 10 years, experience of minimum 5 (five) completed (signing of Concession Agreement) PPP transaction advisory assignment of over INR 200 crore each in any sector.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">In last 10 years, minimum experience 4 (four) projects related to policy development/ project management/ project development for heritage &amp; culture with central government /state government agency.</span></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.96829%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;30 marks</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.60458%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">2</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.28729%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Technical Presentation</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.2188%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Understanding of the assignment.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">General Approach and Methodology with Work Plan.</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Relevant Past Experiences.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.96829%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;30 marks</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.60458%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">3</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.28729%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Candidate Interview </strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.2188%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Team Leader cum Tourism Expert &ndash; 10 marks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Finance Expert &ndash; 10 marks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Urban Planner &ndash; 10 marks</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">Architect &ndash; 10 marks</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">(as per the qualification and experience mentioned in the above Section 6)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.96829%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\">&nbsp;40 marks</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 2.60458%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 8.28729%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 81.2188%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>Total</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 7.96829%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Arial; font-size: small;\"><strong>&nbsp;100 Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\r\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 12/03/2026 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\r\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Signed copy of this EoI</li>\r\n<li>Technical Proposal including Understanding of the Scope of Work, Similar Past Experience, Approach and Methodology and Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">The format of resumes will be as per empanelment tender number<span class=\"s1\"> No. </span><span class=\"s2\">165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025</span><span class=\"s1\">.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '937865', '2026-02-19 16:43:09', 4, 1, '2026-02-19 16:38:11', 109, '2026-02-19 16:43:09', NULL, '2026-02-24 15:55:44', 1, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-24', NULL, 'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)', 'Appointment of PROJECT MANAGEMENT UNIT (PMU) FOR PROVIDING ADVISORY SERVICES TO SIRPUR SPECIAL AREA DEVELOPMENT AUTHORITY (SSADA)', '2026-02-24', '2026-03-02 17:00:00', '2026-03-27 17:00:00', '2026-03-30 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in', '2026-10-02', 1, 1, 0, 'uploads/authorizationletters/OxtqHNIYSE0efmcFQsN0Nj9uNtMcrZd2wnU7Hcu5.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 1, '2,3,4,5', 0, 0, 1, '735633', 'uploads/floated_eois/NgzCZZ7OTqqgaN8dhGm0zOMkiYmdXDjEHuaHUUpe.pdf', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 16919857.14, 0, 0, 3045574.29, 19965431.43, 1, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `eoi_request` (`requestid`, `projectid`, `userid`, `eoinumber`, `isgenerated`, `projecttitle`, `projectduration`, `projectobjective`, `categoryid`, `createdby`, `creationdate`, `isapproved`, `approvedby`, `approvedon`, `approvalremark`, `totalbudget`, `totaladmincharge`, `totalamount`, `operatingmargin`, `tax`, `admincharge`, `aboutproject`, `page_indexing`, `chips_objective`, `scopeofwork`, `anyother`, `termsandcondition`, `evaluation_index`, `evaluationprocess`, `criticalinformation`, `documentrequired`, `replywithremark`, `acceptanceotp`, `acceptancedatetime`, `eoistatus`, `sentby`, `senton`, `confirmedby`, `confirmedon`, `authletter`, `eoifloatdate`, `floatedby`, `presentationfile1`, `isfileuploaded1`, `iscommittee`, `floatdate`, `expirydate`, `issuername`, `engagementname`, `releasedate`, `prebidlastdate`, `deadlinedate`, `interviewdate`, `interview_place`, `selection_method`, `communicationaddress`, `eoiexpirydate`, `isinprebid`, `isordered`, `isupdated`, `authorizationletter`, `draftedeoi`, `isUpdateRequired`, `tier_choice`, `isInterviewSet`, `project_type`, `vendorids`, `iscancelled`, `approvalStatus`, `approvalClosed`, `approvalOtp`, `eoi_file`, `isExtended`, `isSecondCall`, `hasOldPreBid`, `oldRequestId`, `notesheet_file`, `isInterviewDone`, `isMomReceived`, `isDemandNoteRaised`, `isPaymentReceoved`, `isOrderFileReceived`, `corrigendum_file`, `corrigendum_date`, `corrigendum_remark`, `isClosed`, `closedOn`, `closure_file`, `eoi_resource_value`, `eoi_admincharge`, `eoi_operatingcost`, `eoi_tax`, `eoi_total_value`, `isCalculated`, `allowResourceAdd`, `addition_resource_letter`, `upload_time`) VALUES
(121, 39, 14, 'EOI/EMPL/CHiPS/PMU/SYWD/NG2028/2026', 1, 'Setting up of Project Management\nUnit (PMU) for Policy Formulation\nand Execution, Sports\nAdministration, Infrastructure Gap\nAssessment, conduct of national\nmulti-sport events, and assistance in\nproject implementation for hosting\nthe 2028 National Games in the\nState of Chhattisgarh.', '6', '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The Sports &amp; Youth Welfare Department, Government of Chhattisgarh, is dedicated to fostering a vibrant sporting culture and empowering the youth of the State. Established with the vision of promoting physical fitness, sportsmanship, and excellence, the Department works consistently to identify and nurture athletic talent by providing structured programs and state-of-the-art facilities.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">With a balanced focus on both urban and rural areas, the Department ensures equitable access to sporting opportunities across the State. Through initiatives such as the Chhattisgarh Sports Development Program and rural sports outreach initiatives, the Department is committed to elevating athletes to national and international platforms.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">In addition to sports promotion, the Department is equally devoted to youth empowerment. It designs and implements programs aimed at enhancing leadership skills, promoting community engagement, and supporting personal and professional growth. Through youth leadership programs, health and fitness campaigns, and career counselling initiatives, the Department equips young individuals with the necessary skills to contribute meaningfully to society.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Overall, the Sports &amp; Youth Welfare Department strives to create a dynamic ecosystem where sports development and youth empowerment go hand in hand, fostering a future of excellence, inclusivity, and holistic growth for the State.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Need Identification</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The Sports &amp; Youth Welfare Department, Government of Chhattisgarh (SYWD, CG), has undertaken significant initiatives under the State Sports Policy 2017 and has recently established the Chhattisgarh State Sports Authority to further strengthen the sports ecosystem.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">As a next step towards enhancing sporting activities, developing state-of-the-art sports infrastructure, overseeing facility development, strengthening training programs, and promoting talent development initiatives across Chhattisgarh, SYWD intends to engage a strategic consulting firm for setting up a Project Management Unit (PMU). The PMU shall support policy formulation, infrastructure gap assessment, and project implementation assistance for hosting the 2028 National Games in the State of Chhattisgarh.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">SYWD, CG has played a pivotal role in nurturing local talent and creating a sports-friendly environment. However, recognizing the need for specialized expertise to elevate the State&rsquo;s sporting standards further, the Department now proposes to engage external consultants. This initiative aims to strengthen the existing foundation, develop a more robust sports ecosystem, enhance talent nurturing mechanisms, and significantly improve Chhattisgarh&rsquo;s performance at national and international levels.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The engagement of strategic advisors will complement the Department&rsquo;s ongoing efforts in organizing sporting competitions, augmenting sports infrastructure, and implementing athlete-support schemes. The consulting firm will bring global best practices and innovative approaches in areas such as talent identification, establishment of high-performance centres, sports event management, and infrastructure planning.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The advisory firm shall also assist in mobilizing CSR investments from corporate entities for the development of sports infrastructure in Chhattisgarh and facilitate engagement of domain experts for specialized coaching and high-performance training programs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: justify; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">This strategic initiative aligns with the State Government&rsquo;s vision to position Chhattisgarh as a leading sports hub in India. By leveraging professional expertise, the Department aims to accelerate its progress toward creating a vibrant sports culture, developing world-class infrastructure, and producing elite athletes capable of competing at the highest levels. Furthermore, the Department seeks to empower youth through education guidance, specialization pathways, and structured career counselling support.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Purpose</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The Sports &amp; Youth Welfare Department, Government of Chhattisgarh, intends to engage a strategic consulting firm for setting up a Project Management Unit (PMU) to support policy formulation, infrastructure gap assessment, and project implementation for hosting the 2028 National Games in the State of Chhattisgarh, along with providing strategic support in youth upliftment and empowerment.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The PMU shall comprise experienced and qualified professionals in the domains of:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Sports management</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Infrastructure planning</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Finance and budgeting</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Education, Academy and youth development</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Project management</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Procurement</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Information Technology implementation</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">IEC (Information, Education &amp; Communication) and BCC (Behaviour Change Communication)</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The PMU will assist in planning and executing the Department&rsquo;s vision of becoming a leading State in the country with:</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Advanced sports infrastructure</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Increased medal-winning athletes at national and international levels</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">A well-guided and career-oriented youth population</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt;\">Systematic and Efficient Management of the Sports Academy</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Conduct of National/International Sports Event </span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">By establishing the PMU, the Department&rsquo;s broader long-term vision shall be implemented in a structured, systematic, and time-bound manner. The PMU will primarily operate from the Directorate Office of SYWD, Raipur, with travel to other locations across the State as required.</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 1;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">Key Objectives of the PMU</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">The establishment of the Project Management Unit (PMU) shall assist in achieving the following objectives:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&bull; Build a robust Talent Identification and Development system<br>&bull; Create a vibrant and inclusive sports culture across the State<br>&bull; Provide requisite support to sportspersons and key stakeholders<br>&bull; Develop fundamental sports infrastructure with focus on Field-of-Play requirements<br>&bull; Establish ultra-modern training facilities for players and coaches across districts<br>&bull; Set up High-Performance Centres with adequate sports science support<br>&bull; Increase the number of medals at national and international levels<br>&bull; Deploy technology-enabled platforms for performance enhancement<br>&bull; Provide structured career counselling and improved prospects for youth and athletes</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></p>', 2, 14, '2026-02-20 16:33:01', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 2.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 107%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">Part&ndash;A: First 6 Months</span></p>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1. Sports Infrastructure Assessment and Planning</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The Project Management Unit (PMU) shall support the Department in conducting a comprehensive gap analysis of existing sports infrastructure for augmentation, improvement, and upgradation, including assessment of current utilization and operationalization of key facilities for hosting the National Games in a phased manner.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Study sports infrastructure facilities being developed in other States and countries for specific sports and assess their relevance, need, and suitability for Chhattisgarh.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2. Development of Strategic Vision / Policy Document</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Conduct a gap analysis of the existing vision document vis-&agrave;-vis national and global benchmarks.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist SYWD in conducting a demand&ndash;supply analysis to identify priority focus areas, aligned with the National Sports Policy, with special emphasis on Olympic sports.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support SYWD in preparation of a comprehensive 5-year Vision / Policy Document, to be published as a guiding framework for sports development in the State.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate alignment between sports and tourism to introduce innovative initiatives that promote sports development alongside youth upliftment.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">3. Talent Identification Mechanism</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist SYWD in identifying best practices for grassroots-level talent identification.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Prepare a comprehensive Talent Identification Strategy and Execution Plan in consultation with relevant stakeholders and support implementation of talent identification assessments across the State.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist SYWD in designing a structured and transparent selection process for identifying immediate talent as well as potential talent.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo3; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support development of an Athlete Management System and Youth Development Index supported by data analytics.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">4. Preparation of Comprehensive Sports Events Calendar</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in developing an online portal for talent identification and athlete tracking.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo4; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support SYWD in preparation of an annual Sports Events Calendar covering key district, state, national, and international competitions to ensure systematic athlete participation.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">5. Capacity Building</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist SYWD in preparation of a policy framework for an athlete-centered coach development program.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo5; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support preparation and implementation of structured skill development programs for Physical Education Teachers and community coaches across the State.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">Part&ndash;B: Post 6 Months &ndash; Continuous Support for National Games 2028</span></h1>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">1. Sports Infrastructure Assessment and Planning</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The PMU shall assist the Department in mapping all existing, ongoing, and upcoming sports infrastructure projects in the State.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->In consultation with the Department, propose a sustainable utilization plan for sports infrastructure, including leveraging Central and State Government schemes, induction planning, manpower requirements, and operational strategies.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop project-based analysis reports of existing and proposed infrastructure.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo6; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in bid process management for preparation of DPRs for major projects and evaluate the financial viability of proposed models.</p>\r\n<h3><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Bid Process Management Support</span></h3>\r\n<p>The PMU shall assist in managing procurement and onboarding of vendors, including:</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preparation of Terms of Reference (ToR) and bid documents for procurement of goods, services, and allied activities.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Conduct stakeholder consultations to incorporate suggestions into tender documents.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in issuance of EOI/RFP and scheduling of pre-bid meetings.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Draft responses to pre-bid queries and prepare corrigenda/addenda as required.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in drafting contracts and onboarding of service providers / agencies.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h2><span lang=\"EN-IN\">2. Monitoring, Funding &amp; Ecosystem Development</span></h2>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop a structured system/framework for periodic review of infrastructure facilities at district and State levels.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Design monitoring frameworks and coordinate with service providers to ensure seamless execution of projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support drafting of proposals for infrastructure development to secure grant-in-aid under Central schemes and mobilize funding through CSR, DMF, and soft loans from international funding agencies.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in planning and upgrading grassroots-level infrastructure to create a holistic sports ecosystem.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support the Department in managing stakeholder relationships and communication with key agencies and partners.</p>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-size: 21.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 16.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">Talent Development Pathway</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Through structured stakeholder consultations, assist in identifying priority sports disciplines and talent pockets within the State, and prepare a long-term development roadmap for the same.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Through a comprehensive consultative process, assist in developing a structured talent development pathway from grassroots to elite level.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The PMU shall assist the Department in monitoring grassroots development plans and submitting periodic progress reports on all related activities and initiatives.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Identify and recommend an optimal mix of grassroots training centres, intermediate training centres, and elite high-performance centres.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in preparing, developing, and implementing a need-based elite athlete support system.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in reviewing gaps in youth development policy, education policy, and related frameworks, and recommend suitable policy interventions and amendments to achieve the goals and objectives outlined in the Vision Document for Sports.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">3.</span><span style=\"font-size: 17.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\"> Capacity Building</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The PMU shall assist the Department in mapping existing training programs and schemes, preferably through a digital platform.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in conducting skill development workshops for coaches and trainers.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support enhancement of institutional capacity by recommending improvements in processes, SOPs, training modules, and refresher workshops.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in developing in-house capacity for conducting State, National, and International level events of importance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Undertake research to identify and recommend suitable educational courses and potential international collaborations in sports education for Colleges and Universities within the State.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-size: 22.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size: 15.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">Identification and Leveraging of State &amp; Central Government Schemes</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The PMU shall assist the Department in identifying and leveraging various State and Central Government schemes, including but not limited to the Khelo India Scheme and funding programs of the Sports Authority of India.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in preparing, submitting, and following up on DPRs submitted on behalf of the Department.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop a conceptual framework and roadmap to attract funding from corporates, State PSUs, MPLAD funds, CSR initiatives, and other funding sources.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo11; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Study and recommend measures for convergence and harmonization of schemes and programs implemented by the Government of India and the State Government for promotion and development of sports.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 18.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">5</span><span style=\"font-size: 21.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">. </span><span style=\"font-size: 17.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">Project Management Support</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in preparation of dashboards for online monitoring of projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate and organize review meetings with relevant stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Prepare minutes of meetings, discussion notes, presentations, and reports on a regular basis.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide support for day-to-day activities undertaken by the Authority.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Submit Monthly Progress Reports (MPRs).</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo12; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in developing dashboards for monitoring implementation of Central and State Government schemes related to youth development and upliftment.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<h1><span style=\"font-size: 13.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">6. Assistance in Setting up Chhattisgarh&rsquo;s First Sports University</span></h1>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in drafting policy frameworks and regulatory documents for establishing the Sports University.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support identification of potential academic and technical tie-ups in India and abroad.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in bid process management for establishment of the University.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Undertake data collection, monitor project implementation, and provide strategic recommendations.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo13; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with stakeholders to ensure timely completion of on-site works.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 17.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-kerning: 18.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-US;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 17.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 24.0pt;\">7. Other Tasks</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The PMU shall assist the Department in analyzing proposals received from various agencies and stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l12 level1 lfo14; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Undertake any other tasks as assigned by the Department from time to time.</p>\r\n<div class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: center;\" align=\"center\"><hr align=\"center\" size=\"2\" width=\"100%\"></div>', '<pre id=\"tw-target-text\" class=\"tw-data-text tw-text-large tw-ta\" dir=\"ltr\" tabindex=\"-1\" role=\"text\" data-placeholder=\"अनुवाद\" data-ved=\"2ahUKEwjZvcvz7-eSAxWuR2wGHUnAO5EQ3ewLegQIBBAW\" aria-label=\"अनुवाद किया गया टेक्स्ट: Please give preference to those who have previously worked in the sports field and are experienced.\"><span class=\"Y2IQFc\" lang=\"en\">Please give preference to those who have previously worked in the sports field and are experienced.</span></pre>', '<p><strong>PAYMENT TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as<span class=\"s1\"> follows-<br><br></span>\r\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Bidder</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong> </strong><strong>Presentation</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Candidates </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Profile</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>50 </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>50 </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Key </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Evaluation Criteria</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Approach</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">and</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Methodology</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Understanding</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of the</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Quality</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">proposed</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">methodology</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">for</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">such</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">specific</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">kind</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">a project. (Sports Consulting/Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Prior</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">exposure</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">in</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">similar</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">government</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">projects</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">related</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">to Sports Consulting/ Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events along with experience in education sector for youth empowerment.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Suitability</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of the</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> profile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Educational</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Qualification</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Years</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">relevant</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Experience</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Experience</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Working</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">in Government Projects</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Excellent</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">communication </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">abilities</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\r\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 18/03/2026 05:00 PM. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\r\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p>It has been observed that the EoI received mentions 4 resources, whereas the enclosed request letter mentions only 2 consultants. Kindly revise the request letter so that it matches the EoI and update the same accordingly.</p>', '772050', '2026-02-25 16:31:40', 4, 1, '2026-02-25 15:52:35', 14, '2026-02-25 16:31:40', NULL, '2026-03-05 12:29:19', 1, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-05', NULL, 'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)', 'Setting up of a Project Management Unit (PMU) for policy formulation and execution, sports administration, infrastructure gap assessment, conduct of n', '2026-03-05', '2026-03-10 17:00:00', '2026-04-03 17:00:00', '2026-04-15 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in', '2026-10-08', 1, 1, 0, 'uploads/authorizationletters/5b0ku808g0NGCOHXpStq9aMdPx7P7XyfCzg31nRK.pdf', NULL, 0, 3, 1, 0, '1,2,3,4,5,7,8', 0, 0, 1, NULL, 'uploads/floated_eois/0TVm8OMgLZCcFexRlRb4YO3pGZSfy4Zb3mv9tgsA.pdf', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 4682335.48, 0, 0, 842820.39, 5525155.87, 1, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `eoi_request` (`requestid`, `projectid`, `userid`, `eoinumber`, `isgenerated`, `projecttitle`, `projectduration`, `projectobjective`, `categoryid`, `createdby`, `creationdate`, `isapproved`, `approvedby`, `approvedon`, `approvalremark`, `totalbudget`, `totaladmincharge`, `totalamount`, `operatingmargin`, `tax`, `admincharge`, `aboutproject`, `page_indexing`, `chips_objective`, `scopeofwork`, `anyother`, `termsandcondition`, `evaluation_index`, `evaluationprocess`, `criticalinformation`, `documentrequired`, `replywithremark`, `acceptanceotp`, `acceptancedatetime`, `eoistatus`, `sentby`, `senton`, `confirmedby`, `confirmedon`, `authletter`, `eoifloatdate`, `floatedby`, `presentationfile1`, `isfileuploaded1`, `iscommittee`, `floatdate`, `expirydate`, `issuername`, `engagementname`, `releasedate`, `prebidlastdate`, `deadlinedate`, `interviewdate`, `interview_place`, `selection_method`, `communicationaddress`, `eoiexpirydate`, `isinprebid`, `isordered`, `isupdated`, `authorizationletter`, `draftedeoi`, `isUpdateRequired`, `tier_choice`, `isInterviewSet`, `project_type`, `vendorids`, `iscancelled`, `approvalStatus`, `approvalClosed`, `approvalOtp`, `eoi_file`, `isExtended`, `isSecondCall`, `hasOldPreBid`, `oldRequestId`, `notesheet_file`, `isInterviewDone`, `isMomReceived`, `isDemandNoteRaised`, `isPaymentReceoved`, `isOrderFileReceived`, `corrigendum_file`, `corrigendum_date`, `corrigendum_remark`, `isClosed`, `closedOn`, `closure_file`, `eoi_resource_value`, `eoi_admincharge`, `eoi_operatingcost`, `eoi_tax`, `eoi_total_value`, `isCalculated`, `allowResourceAdd`, `addition_resource_letter`, `upload_time`) VALUES
(122, 38, 111, 'EoI/CSF/PMU/RDA/2026', 1, 'Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Providing Advisory Services to Raipur Development Authority (RDA)', '24', '<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 49.65pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Raipur Development Authority (RDA) is a special area development authority established by GoCG under the Chhattisgarh Nagar Tatha Gram Nivesh Adhiniyam, 1973 for development and administration of Raipur Development Authority.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 49.65pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">RDA is actively engaged in the development of land parcels through the implement action of Town Development Schemes (TDS) by way of land reconstitution.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 49.65pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">RDA has already prepared development plan for various infrastructure services such as water supply, sewerage, drainage, roads, communication, power supply etc. The development plan of the city divides the city in sectors and the city is envisaged to be developed in phases.</span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 49.65pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">RDA also undertake in-house various planning tasks such as Area planning, sector planning, village development plans, modifications in Development Plans, Development codes and prepare various development policies, etc. as per requirement.</span></h1>', 2, 111, '2026-02-20 18:22:51', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 18, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<h1 style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0in; line-height: 115%; tab-stops: 51.55pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The PMU </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">will work in tandem with the existing department staff and shall be responsible, amongst others, for the following services:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></h1>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -30.85pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 78.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">A.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Mandatory Scope of Work</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 87.55pt; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>I.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Formulation of Business Plan </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the authority in project identification and project prioritization, business and industry assessment, formulation of new business strategies for improving investment in Raipur.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Supporting the authority in formulating business model, financial model and detailed project structuring.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l8 level1 lfo4; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the authority in financial planning by assessment of past fiscal history, formulation of cash flow models and improving debt management system. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 105.55pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 87.55pt; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>II.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Transaction Advisory Services<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 126.7pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the authority in attaining the objective of eco-sensitive development of the project </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 126.7pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Performing site visits, collection of information and assisting the authority in understanding the minimum development commitments of individual projects. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 126.7pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Supporting the authority in identifying suitable opportunities for project development under PPP framework, along with stakeholder consultations </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l2 level1 lfo5; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 126.7pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Supporting the authority in management of pricing and lease structure of various land banks owned by the authority </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 108.7pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 87.55pt; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>III.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Tender Process Management<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Preliminary market assessment<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Preparation and assistance in floating tender documents, expression of interest, RFPs, RFQs </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the authority in RFP stage, technical and financial evaluation of prospective Tenderers</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assistance to authority in preparation of Concession Agreement/ Lease Agreement/ License Agreement/ MoU, etc. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l5 level1 lfo6; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Negotiation assistance and contract management </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0in; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><em style=\"mso-bidi-font-style: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">RDA will get all the bid documents and Agreements legally vetted on its own.</span></em></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 87.55pt; text-indent: -87.55pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>IV.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Policy Review And Legal Framework<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo7; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the authority in analysing the project specific requirements for transparent allotment of land parcels by formulating an efficient process. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo7; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">For making the land allotment process efficient, assistance to authority in properly defining the process of application and decision.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo7; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assisting the anything in managing the legal case ensuring from past contacts / claims.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l0 level1 lfo7; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">For making the legal framework efficient in the interests of the authority advising properly defining the process of decision.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: 0in; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 123.55pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h1 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -28.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2; tab-stops: 51.55pt; margin: 0in 0in 12.0pt 78.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">B.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-weight: normal; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Additional Scope of Work</span></h1>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 114.0pt; text-indent: -114.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>I.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Post-Award Contract Management in Development Period Stage<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 114.0pt; text-indent: 0in;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Scope of work encompasses Post-Award Contract Management only in Development period stage and it doesn&rsquo;t include Construction, Operation and Management or Handover stage.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>It shall include following activities:<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Monitor performance with respect to all receipt of all permissions, clearance, land and other condition precedents being met on time.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assist authority in evaluating concessionaire&rsquo;s financial models for achievement of financial closure in case of PPP Projects.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assist authority in commencement of building strategic relationships with all stakeholders and other authority officials associated with the project.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assist authority in managing all public communication activities.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assist authority in planning contract Management practices.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l1 level1 lfo8; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Assist authority in planning resource management plan of in-house resources, whose responsibilities are associated with the project.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 132.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 114.0pt; text-indent: -114.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>II.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Standard Operating Procedure (SOP) for the Projects and Finance Department of RDA</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo9; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Study shall be done to map out systems and procedures to be used in the Projects &amp; Finance Department of RDA to ensure that the workflows are both efficient and economical in terms of time and labour. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo9; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The SOP are expected to guide the future operations of the RDA and shall ensure a well thought out and standardized approach to workflows and prevailing policy and legislation that needs to be adhered to, both internally and externally. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo9; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">The setup of SOP shall include preparation of comprehensive set of standard documents and forms that can be used. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo9; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Preparation of set of documents/ tools on excel for proper monitoring and evaluation of identified and existing ongoing projects.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l6 level1 lfo9; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Three Workshop for each department on monthly basis shall be held with the project team mid-way through the process to check on the accuracy of mapping.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 114.0pt; text-indent: -114.0pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>III.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Review of existing Land Disposal Rules<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Benchmarking of RDA&rsquo;s disposal rules with other development Authorities in India<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Suggest and Assist Authority in modifications of disposal rules on the basis of benchmarking<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-list: l9 level1 lfo10; margin: 0in 0in .0001pt 150.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Other activities as assigned by the Authority shall be demand to be mutually agreed in contract.</span></p>', NULL, '<p><span class=\"s1\"><strong>Payment Terms</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/ discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience if any in similar area of expertise (Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (Physically/Via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">The marking for presentation and Interview will be done as follows-<br><br>\r\n<table style=\"width: 100%; height: 248px;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 52px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.2049%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 68.713%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; Bidder</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong> </strong><strong>Presentation</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.7666%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; Candidates </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Profile</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 52px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.2049%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 68.713%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; 50 </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.7666%; height: 52px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; 50 </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Marks</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr style=\"height: 144px;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 10.2049%; height: 144px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"justify\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>&nbsp; Key </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Evaluation&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; Criteria</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 68.713%; height: 144px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Approach</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">and</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Methodology</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Understanding</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of the</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Project</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Quality</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">proposed</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">methodology</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">for</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">such</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">specific</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">kind</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">a project. (Sports Consulting/Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events)</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Prior</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">exposure</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">in</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">similar</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">government</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">projects</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">related</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">to Sports Consulting/ Sports Infrastructure Planning &amp; Monitoring/ Sports Events along with experience in education sector for youth empowerment.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 20.7666%; height: 144px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Suitability</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of the</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> profile</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Educational</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Qualification</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Years</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">relevant</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Experience</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Experience</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">of</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Working</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">in Government Projects</span></li>\r\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">Excellent</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">communication </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: medium;\">abilities</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\r\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 13/03/2026 17:00 hrs. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\r\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\r\n</ul>', '<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Signed copy of this EOI</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Copy of Approach and methodology presentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Resumes of resources that will face the interview.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '239853', '2026-02-24 17:06:49', 4, 1, '2026-02-24 16:56:49', 111, '2026-02-24 17:06:49', NULL, '2026-03-03 15:26:24', 1, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-03-03', NULL, 'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)', 'For Setting up of Project Management Unit (PMU) for Providing Advisory Services to Raipur Development Authority (RDA)', '2026-03-03', '2026-03-09 17:00:00', '2026-03-24 17:00:00', '2026-03-25 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in', '2026-10-07', 1, 1, 0, 'uploads/authorizationletters/FfexmRmD3Dxf2lF9PttrxBkurbU67f5SKtQJX4YR.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 0, '2,3,4,5', 0, 0, 1, '416401', 'uploads/floated_eois/OxtqHNIYSE0efmcFQsN0Nj9uNtMcrZd2wnU7Hcu5.pdf', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 0, 0, 1, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 33698429.03, 0, 0, 6065717.23, 39764146.26, 1, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `eoi_request` (`requestid`, `projectid`, `userid`, `eoinumber`, `isgenerated`, `projecttitle`, `projectduration`, `projectobjective`, `categoryid`, `createdby`, `creationdate`, `isapproved`, `approvedby`, `approvedon`, `approvalremark`, `totalbudget`, `totaladmincharge`, `totalamount`, `operatingmargin`, `tax`, `admincharge`, `aboutproject`, `page_indexing`, `chips_objective`, `scopeofwork`, `anyother`, `termsandcondition`, `evaluation_index`, `evaluationprocess`, `criticalinformation`, `documentrequired`, `replywithremark`, `acceptanceotp`, `acceptancedatetime`, `eoistatus`, `sentby`, `senton`, `confirmedby`, `confirmedon`, `authletter`, `eoifloatdate`, `floatedby`, `presentationfile1`, `isfileuploaded1`, `iscommittee`, `floatdate`, `expirydate`, `issuername`, `engagementname`, `releasedate`, `prebidlastdate`, `deadlinedate`, `interviewdate`, `interview_place`, `selection_method`, `communicationaddress`, `eoiexpirydate`, `isinprebid`, `isordered`, `isupdated`, `authorizationletter`, `draftedeoi`, `isUpdateRequired`, `tier_choice`, `isInterviewSet`, `project_type`, `vendorids`, `iscancelled`, `approvalStatus`, `approvalClosed`, `approvalOtp`, `eoi_file`, `isExtended`, `isSecondCall`, `hasOldPreBid`, `oldRequestId`, `notesheet_file`, `isInterviewDone`, `isMomReceived`, `isDemandNoteRaised`, `isPaymentReceoved`, `isOrderFileReceived`, `corrigendum_file`, `corrigendum_date`, `corrigendum_remark`, `isClosed`, `closedOn`, `closure_file`, `eoi_resource_value`, `eoi_admincharge`, `eoi_operatingcost`, `eoi_tax`, `eoi_total_value`, `isCalculated`, `allowResourceAdd`, `addition_resource_letter`, `upload_time`) VALUES
(123, 37, 63, 'EoI/EMPL/CHiPS/E-Pragati/2026', 1, 'For Selection of Project Management Consultant for ePragati Portal', '12', '<p><strong>About</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>the</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"s2\"><strong>Project</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">e‑Pragati is a centralized governance platform designed for monitoring and resolving issues related to high‑value, long‑duration, and delayed government projects. It enables structured issue tracking, inter‑departmental coordination, and supervisory oversight, thereby improving transparency, accountability, and timely decision‑making across departments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The High‑value government projects often face delays and bottlenecks due to fragmented information sources, non‑uniform data formats, and limited coordination among stakeholders. This leads to delayed, unclear, or inconsistent information reaching decision‑makers, affecting overall project progress.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The absence of an integrated monitoring system may contribute to the continuation of bottlenecks and can slow administrative action. These gaps indicate the need for a centralized, structured, and regularly monitored mechanism supported by ePragati and a dedicated PMU.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The Project Management Unit (PMU) provides full‑time support for planning, tracking, analytics, documentation, and follow‑up activities that require focused effort beyond routine departmental capacity. It ensures standardized reporting, uniform data formats, and consolidated dashboards across departments, reducing variations in information flow and enabling timely administrative action.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p5\">&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><strong>Purpose</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\">The purpose of this engagement is to support the Office of Chief Secretary, Government of Chhattisgarh, in monitoring highvalue projects as defined, and delayed projects through the ePragati platform. It aims to enable systematic tracking of projectrelated issues, early identification of bottlenecks, and timely escalation for resolution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p3\">The engagement of PMU is expected to achieve clear and measurable outcomes such as reduced pendency of issues, faster resolution cycles, improved departmental coordination and responsiveness, and stronger, datadriven decisionmaking for senior leadership. These outcomes ensure that monitoring efforts translate into timely administrative action and more efficient project execution.</p>', 2, 63, '2026-02-26 16:51:36', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 0, 18, 5, NULL, NULL, NULL, '<p class=\"p1\"><strong>1. Objective:&nbsp;</strong>The PMU shall provide advisory, monitoring, and facilitative support to the Office of the Chief Secretary, including strengthening the e‑Pragati portal as a centralized, role‑based system for tracking and resolving issues in large projects, specific campaigns identified and delayed projects. The engagement shall focus on analytics, inter‑departmental coordination, and structured monitoring through e‑Pragati portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><strong>2. Project Coverage:&nbsp;</strong>The PMU shall assist in monitoring and analysis of issues related to the following categories of High Value projects captured in the e-Pragati portal:</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Projects with an estimated cost exceeding <span class=\"s1\">₹</span>25 crore</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Projects with an estimated or actual execution period of more than two (2) years</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Projects experiencing delays, irrespective of project cost</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Any other projects selected by department secretaries or by Hon. Chief Minister/ Office of Chief Secretary.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p5\"><strong>3. Stakeholder Coverage and Coordination:&nbsp;</strong>The PMU shall facilitate coordination, reporting, and monitoring support<span class=\"Apple-converted-space\">&nbsp; </span>among the departments with office of CS.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><strong>4. Monitoring Workflow Support:&nbsp;</strong>The PMU shall support and oversee a structured and standardized monitoring workflow on the e-Pragati portal, including:</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Review and validation of project and task information entered by departments</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Monitoring of issues raised against projects or tasks for intradepartmental and interdepartmental coordination</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Tracking assignment and progress of issues across departments.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Identification of bottlenecks, delays, and unresolved issues requiring escalation</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Providing analytical inputs and summaries to senior authorities, including Hon. CM Office and CS Office, for supervisory review and intervention</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">The PMU shall also closely work with CHiPS team</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>5. Project Issue Tracking and Status Management</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p6\">The PMU shall monitor and report on project issues across the following status stages: Pending for Update, In Progress, Request for Closure, and Closed.</p>\r\n<p class=\"p7\">The Key responsibilities include:</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Reviewing all issue updates and status changes for completeness and consistency.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Identifying and flagging issues that remain pending for long durations or are repeatedly reopened.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Supporting the verification of compliance and required actions before recommending closure.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Highlighting further action where the reported resolution is inadequate.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p5\"><strong>6. Data Review and Monitoring Inputs:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ol class=\"ol1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\"><strong>e-Pragati Portal: </strong>The PMU shall utilize and analyze information available in the portal, including:</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<ul class=\"ul2\">\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Project Details: Project category, name, brief description, and location</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Task Details: Task name and task description</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Issue Details: Issue title, detailed description, supporting documents.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>7. Reporting and Decision Support</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p9\">The PMU shall provide periodic monitoring and decisionsupport outputs, including:</p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Consolidated issue status reports</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Reports highlighting critical, delayed, or highrisk issues</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Analytical notes on interdepartmental dependencies and systemic bottlenecks</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Inputs for review meetings chaired by Hon. CM Office and CS Office or other competent authorities.</li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '<p><strong>Payment</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"s2\"><strong>terms<br></strong></span>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following <span class=\"s1\">schedule.</span></p>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li2\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\n<li class=\"li3\">For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Penalty</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"s2\"><strong>terms</strong></span></p>\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\n<li class=\"li1\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment<span class=\"s1\"> terms.</span></li>\n<li class=\"li2\"><strong>Important Note: </strong>All other terms and conditions of tender <strong>165081 / CEO / CHiPS / Empanelment / Consultancy Firms / 2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025 </strong>shall be applicable to this EOI.</li>\n</ul>', NULL, '<ul>\r\n<li>CHiPS will constitute an Evaluation Committee whose decision will be final in the evaluation of the responses to the Expression of Interest. No correspondence will be entertained outside the process of negotiation/discussion with the Committee.</li>\r\n<li>A presentation will be made by the bidding company about their understanding of the proposed area of work and their experience, if any, in a similar area of expertise (via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>During the presentation by the companies, the Evaluation Committee will interview the proposed candidates (via Video Conference).</li>\r\n<li>The marking for presentation and interview will be done as follows:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<table border=\"1\" width=\"100%\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"8\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr>\r\n<th>Key Evaluation Criteria</th>\r\n<th>Bidder Presentation<br>(50 Marks)</th>\r\n<th>Candidate Interview<br>(50 Marks)</th>\r\n</tr>\r\n</thead>\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td><strong>Criteria</strong></td>\r\n<td>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Approach and Methodology</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of the Project Framework</li>\r\n<li>Quality of proposed methodology for such a specific kind of project</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Prior exposure to Quality certification</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n<td>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Suitability of <span class=\"s1\">profile</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Years of relevant <span class=\"s1\">experience</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Good understanding of project management best practices <span class=\"s1\">framework</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Strong ability to <span class=\"s1\">understand</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">and deliberate and report monitor the key SLAs</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Communication <span class=\"s1\">abilities</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>', '<ul>\n<li>Bidder agencies are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this document with full understanding of its terms, conditions, and implications.</li>\n<li>The last date for submission of response is 19/03/2026 05:00 PM. Any response received after the above deadline will be rejected.</li>\n<li>The preferred mode of communication for query resolution is through email to: <br><br><strong>CEO, CHiPS</strong><br>State Data Centre, Civil Lines,<br>Raipur &ndash; 492001<br>Email: ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in<br>Tel: +91-771-4014158 | Fax: +91-771-4014158</li>\n</ul>', '<ul>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Signed copy of this <span class=\"s1\">EoI.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Experience of the bidding firm along with relevant Work Orders/<span class=\"s2\"> documents</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">Copy of Approach and methodology <span class=\"s2\">presentation.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">Resumes of resources that will face the <span class=\"s2\">interview.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', NULL, '321623', '2026-02-26 17:05:58', 4, 1, '2026-02-26 16:54:52', 63, '2026-02-26 17:05:58', NULL, '2026-02-26 17:13:51', 1, NULL, 0, 0, '2026-02-26', NULL, 'Chhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)', 'Expression of Interest (EOI) for Selection of Project Management Consultant for e-Pragati Portal', '2026-02-26', '2026-03-03 17:00:00', '2026-03-19 17:00:00', '2026-03-20 12:00:00', NULL, NULL, 'Chief Executive Officer\r\nChhattisgarh Infotech Promotion Society (CHiPS)\r\nState Data Centre Building, Near Police Control Room, Civil Lines, Raipur, Chhattisgarh-492001\r\nTel : 91771-404158\r\nEmail : ceochips@nic.in, empl.chips@cgchips.in', '2026-10-09', 0, 1, 0, 'uploads/authorizationletters/OsQFfXAqb3dIbUoVz0epO4rPOtXa7hRJBSS6elDe.pdf', NULL, 0, 1, 1, 1, '1,2,3,4,5', 0, 0, 1, NULL, 'uploads/floated_eois/t3JY3iRELWOTzCAaw8UbnIh1j8NXMa1YZWt2WY2C.pdf', 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, NULL, NULL, 8462357.14, 0, 0, 1523224.29, 9985581.43, 1, 0, NULL, NULL);
INSERT INTO `eoi_request` (`requestid`, `projectid`, `userid`, `eoinumber`, `isgenerated`, `projecttitle`, `projectduration`, `projectobjective`, `categoryid`, `createdby`, `creationdate`, `isapproved`, `approvedby`, `approvedon`, `approvalremark`, `totalbudget`, `totaladmincharge`, `totalamount`, `operatingmargin`, `tax`, `admincharge`, `aboutproject`, `page_indexing`, `chips_objective`, `scopeofwork`, `anyother`, `termsandcondition`, `evaluation_index`, `evaluationprocess`, `criticalinformation`, `documentrequired`, `replywithremark`, `acceptanceotp`, `acceptancedatetime`, `eoistatus`, `sentby`, `senton`, `confirmedby`, `confirmedon`, `authletter`, `eoifloatdate`, `floatedby`, `presentationfile1`, `isfileuploaded1`, `iscommittee`, `floatdate`, `expirydate`, `issuername`, `engagementname`, `releasedate`, `prebidlastdate`, `deadlinedate`, `interviewdate`, `interview_place`, `selection_method`, `communicationaddress`, `eoiexpirydate`, `isinprebid`, `isordered`, `isupdated`, `authorizationletter`, `draftedeoi`, `isUpdateRequired`, `tier_choice`, `isInterviewSet`, `project_type`, `vendorids`, `iscancelled`, `approvalStatus`, `approvalClosed`, `approvalOtp`, `eoi_file`, `isExtended`, `isSecondCall`, `hasOldPreBid`, `oldRequestId`, `notesheet_file`, `isInterviewDone`, `isMomReceived`, `isDemandNoteRaised`, `isPaymentReceoved`, `isOrderFileReceived`, `corrigendum_file`, `corrigendum_date`, `corrigendum_remark`, `isClosed`, `closedOn`, `closure_file`, `eoi_resource_value`, `eoi_admincharge`, `eoi_operatingcost`, `eoi_tax`, `eoi_total_value`, `isCalculated`, `allowResourceAdd`, `addition_resource_letter`, `upload_time`) VALUES
(124, 0, 110, 'EOI/PMC/NRANSCCL/IT/2026', 1, 'Selection of Project Management Consultant (PMC) for various ICT works under NRANSCCL, Nava Raipur Atal Nagar, Raipur', '18', '<p>As per the GoI guidelines, Nava Raipur Atal Nagar Vikas Pradhikaran has formed a separate Special Purpose Vehicle (SPV) as Nava Raipur Atal Nagar Smart City Corporation Limited (NRANSCCL) for the implementation of Smart Solution Projects under the smart city mission for the city of Nava Raipur Atal Nagar. The smart city proposal of Nava Raipur Atal Nagar includes several Pan City and Area Based Development initiatives with a focus on both infrastructure and ICT advancements across the city and at strategic locations. The strategic focus of the city has been identified to improve mobility, improve situational awareness, enhance public safety and security, and introduce data driven decision-making.<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Objective and Background of the Projects under NRANSCCL<br><br></strong></span>NRANSCCL being a SPV of NRANVP are executing multiple ICT Projects under the Smart City Mission. These Projects are currently under the Operation and Maintenance Phase and will continue till the end of the O&amp;M Period. The details of the Projects are mentioned below:<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"height: 393px; width: 93.3846%; border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Sl.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>No.</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Name</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>of</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>the</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Project</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Current</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Status</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Project</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Completion </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Timelines</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">1.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Digital</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">City</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Platform</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Pilot</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Project</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Under</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">extended</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">O&amp;M</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">31.03.2026</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">2.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Digital City Platform Project &ndash; Roll out of Additional Modules</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Under</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">O&amp;M</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">31.03.2028</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">3.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Smart</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Metering</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Water</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Project</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Under</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">O&amp;M</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">31.12.2027</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">4.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Variable</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Message</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Signage</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">System</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Project</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Under</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">O&amp;M</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">(Partially)</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">30.06.2028</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p align=\"right\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">5.</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Upgradation and 3 Years of O&amp;M of the </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">ICCC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 19.8389%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">Under</span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"> </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">tendering </span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">process</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 25.7967%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\">31.03.2030</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p><br>The Project &ldquo;Digital City Platform Pilot Project&rdquo; is under extended O&amp;M Period and is likely to be completed by 31.03.2026. This Project was executed through NRANSCCL. A new RFP has been floated by NRANVP for Upgradation of the existing ICCC and further O&amp;M of the Project for 3 years.<br><br>The PMC team would be responsible for managing all the ICT Projects under NRANSCCL and the Upgradation Project of the ICCC under NRANVP.<br><br>The details of the ongoing Projects are mentioned below: <br>1. Digital City Platform Pilot Project (ICCC Project phase I): <br>a. Project Start Date: April 2017 <br>b. Project End Date: July 2024<br>c. Project extended Period: Till March 2026 <br>d. The Tracks and Components of the Project:<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"width: 94.2308%; border-collapse: collapse; border-width: 1px; border-spacing: 0px;\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 5.70988%; border-width: 1px;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=