(39, 5, 1, 3, 2, '', '(7+ years)', 2, 48, '', 0, 0, NULL, '36', 'FULL TIME', 934560, 0, '2025-10-29 01:09:24', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Minimum eight (08) years of work experience in the urban sector, including housing, urban, or real estate projects, with expertise in housing.  Experience in assisting housing boards in successfully closing at least three (03) redevelopment or re-densification projects, evidenced by the selection of a developer.  Successfully led or closed at least five (05) assignments involving the private sector in the monetization of land, urban infrastructure, and amenities.  Experience of working on projects funded by International Financial Institutions (IFIs) in the housing sector.  Experience of working in Chhattisgarh would be an added advantage.  Should be a permanent employee of the firm for at least the last three (03) years.', 1, 360000, 0, 0, 18, 142560, 5, 46728, 981288, 0),
