(3496, 98, 2, 0, 0, 'Programmer - PHP MVC Framework', '5-9 Years', 1, 25, 'Bachelor’s/Master’s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.  5+ years of hands-on experience in PHP development using MVC frameworks.  Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.  Proficient in:  PHP (Object-Oriented Programming)  MVC frameworks like Laravel, CodeIgniter, or Symfony  MySQL/PostgreSQL  JavaScript, jQuery, AJAX, HTML5, CSS3  Familiarity with version control systems such as Git.  Understanding of RESTful APIs and web security principles.', 7, 0, NULL, '12', 'FULL TIME', 1177545.6, 0, '2025-12-26 14:17:16', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, 75600, 10, 90720, 18, 179625.6, 0, 0, 1177545.6, 0),
(3497, 98, 2, 0, 0, 'Programmer CMS developer', '5-9 Years', 1, 25, 'Bachelor’s/Master’s Degree in Computer Science, IT, or a related field.  5+ years of experience in CMS development.  Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.  Proficient in:  CMS platforms like WordPress, Drupal, or Joomla  PHP, HTML5, CSS3, JavaScript, jQuery  MySQL/MariaDB  Experience with custom theme/plugin/module development.  Familiarity with Git and version control workflows.', 7, 0, NULL, '12', 'FULL TIME', 1177545.6, 0, '2025-12-26 14:17:58', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, 75600, 10, 90720, 18, 179625.6, 0, 0, 1177545.6, 0),
(3498, 98, 2, 0, 0, 'Database Administrative', '5-9 Years', 1, 25, 'Bachelor’s/Master’s Degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, or a related field.  5+ years of experience as a Database Administrator.  Preference will be given to experienced candidates of work in Govt. Organization.  Proficient in:  RDBMS platforms (MySQL, PostgreSQL, MS SQL Server, or Oracle)  Writing and optimizing SQL queries, stored procedures, triggers, and views  Backup, recovery, and replication techniques  Experience with monitoring tools and performance tuning.', 7, 0, NULL, '12', 'FULL TIME', 1177545.6, 0, '2025-12-26 14:18:47', NULL, NULL, NULL, '', 1, 75600, 10, 90720, 18, 179625.6, 0, 0, 1177545.6, 0),
