(1016, 0, 205, 3570, 454, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-25', NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 6, 3, '', '(5+ years)', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">M.Sc. Agriculture, M.Sc. Horticulture / Agriculture Extension / Agribusiness Management or equivalent.</span></p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum 5+<strong> years</strong> in agriculture and allied sector development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in farmer producer organizations (FPOs), agri-value chains, livestock development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in convergence with agriculture department schemes.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of climate-resilient agriculture practices.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Project Specific Requirements:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess agricultural practices, constraints, and potential in DMF/mining-affected areas.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of agriculture, horticulture, fisheries, and animal husbandry projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Promote sustainable, climate-resilient, and resource-efficient farming practices.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical guidance on animal husbandry and livestock development, including breed improvement, veterinary support, fodder development, and dairy/poultry/livestock-based livelihoods.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support horticulture development, including high-value crops, orchards, kitchen gardens, nursery development, and post-harvest management.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate convergence with Agriculture, Horticulture, Fisheries, Animal Husbandry, and allied departments.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for crop diversification, productivity enhancement, value addition, and agri-enterprise development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Monitor progress and outcomes of agriculture and allied sector interventions and recommend corrective measures. <span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Support farmer outreach, capacity building, demonstrations, training programs, and documentation of best practices and results.</span></span></p>', 160, 336000.00, 336000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 351360.00, 5.00, 115168.00, 2418528.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-05-25', '2026-11-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1017, 0, 205, 3571, 455, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-25', NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 6, 3, '', '(5+ years)', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Master’s in Environmental Science / Environmental Engineering / Urban Planning or equivalent.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">  </span></span></p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in environmental management, pollution control, WASH, or housing projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in DPR preparation and environmental safeguards.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of mining-related environmental impacts (Desirable).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in coordination with Pollution Control Board / Environment Department.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;<strong>Project Specific Requirements:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support integration of environmental sustainability and safeguards in DMF planning and project implementation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical advice on environmentally sustainable practices in infrastructure, mining-affected area restoration, and community projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of drinking water supply interventions, including centralized purification systems, water treatment plants, piped water supply networks, and standalone drinking water facilities.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in environment preservation and pollution control measures, including effluent treatment plants, control of air and dust pollution, mine drainage systems, mine pollution prevention technologies, and protection of surface and groundwater sources.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support identification of mineral-specific pollutants and environmental hazards, including collaboration with research and technical institutions, and implementation of air quality monitoring systems.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in planning and implementation of sanitation initiatives, including solid and liquid waste management, drainage systems, sewage treatment plants, fecal sludge management, public toilet facilities, and cleanliness drives.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support housing interventions, including provision of pucca housing for mining-affected people not covered under Central or State schemes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Draft and review Terms of Reference (ToRs), DPRs, and technical proposals related to environmental protection, water, sanitation, and housing projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with Forest, Mining, Environment, Urban Development, and allied departments to ensure convergence and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support awareness generation, community engagement, and capacity building on environmental protection, water conservation, sanitation, and sustainable development. <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Monitor project implementation, track environmental outcomes, and recommend corrective actions where required.</span></p>', 160, 336000.00, 336000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 351360.00, 5.00, 115168.00, 2418528.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-05-25', '2026-11-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1018, 0, 205, 3572, 456, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-25', NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 6, 3, '', '(5+ years)', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Master’s in Rural Development / Social Work / Development Studies / Economics / Livelihoods / MBA (Rural Management).</span></p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in livelihood promotion, SHG strengthening, skill development, or rural enterprise.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience with NRLM, skill missions, or livelihood programs.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in working with vulnerable groups (elderly, differently-abled persons).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of social welfare schemes and DDRC coordination.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Project Specific Requirements:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support livelihood enhancement and income generation interventions for DMF/mining-affected communities.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess livelihood patterns, vulnerabilities, and economic opportunities in affected areas.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support design and implementation of livelihood promotion programs, including skill development, enterprise development, and self-employment.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Develop innovative project proposals and strategies for sustainable livelihood generation.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate convergence with skill development, rural development, and employment schemes of State and Central Governments.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical guidance on market linkages, entrepreneurship, value chains, SHGs, FPOs, and community institutions.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Monitor progress, outputs, and outcomes of livelihood interventions and recommend course corrections.</p>\r\n<p><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support community engagement and stakeholder coordination, including SHGs, FPOs, cooperatives, and local bodies.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Implement special programmes for welfare of aged and differently-abled persons, including medical support, social assistance, and inclusion measures.</span></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support initiatives and coordination for financial assistance to District Disability Rehabilitation Centres (DDRCs).</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Document best practices, impact stories, and lessons learned from livelihood and social welfare interventions.</span></span></p>', 160, 336000.00, 336000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 351360.00, 5.00, 115168.00, 2418528.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-05-25', '2026-11-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1019, 0, 205, 3573, 457, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-05-25', NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 6, 3, '', '(5+ years)', 0, '<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Master’s in Health Administration / Public Health / Nutrition / Social Work (Health specialization) or equivalent </span></p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in public health, maternal &amp; child health, nutrition, or health systems strengthening.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience working with government health programs (NHM, ICDS, Poshan Abhiyaan etc.).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in health infrastructure planning and program monitoring.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of mining-related health risks (Desirable).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Project Specific Requirements:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning, implementation, and monitoring of health and nutrition-related interventions, with a focus on mining-affected communities.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support assessment of health and nutrition needs in DMF-affected areas, especially populations impacted by mining-related health risks.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in design and prioritization of health and nutrition interventions under DMF, aligned with PMKKKY guidelines.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support development and strengthening of primary and secondary health care facilities in affected areas, ensuring not only infrastructure creation but also adequate staffing (doctors, paramedical and support staff), equipment, and essential medical supplies.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ensure interventions supplement and converge with existing health infrastructure of Local Bodies, State Government, and Central Government.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate technical collaboration with the National Institute of Miners&rsquo; Health for designing specialized health infrastructure to address mining-related illnesses and diseases, including support for mobile health care units in affected regions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of Group Insurance Schemes for health care for mining-affected persons, where applicable.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Design and support special programmes for Women and Children, focusing on maternal and child health, malnutrition, infectious diseases, and other priority health concerns under PMKKKY.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with Health Department, ICDS, Women &amp; Child Development, and allied departments to ensure effective convergence and service delivery.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for program design, operational guidelines, implementation frameworks, and monitoring mechanisms for health and nutrition outcomes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Review progress of health, nutrition, and women &amp; child welfare projects, and recommend corrective measures for improved impact.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support capacity building of frontline workers, awareness campaigns, and community engagement initiatives to promote preventive health and nutrition practices.</p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Contribute to reporting, documentation, monitoring, evaluation, and knowledge management related to health, nutrition, and social welfare outcomes in DMF area.</span></span></p>', 160, 336000.00, 336000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 351360.00, 5.00, 115168.00, 2418528.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-05-25', '2026-11-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
