e: 14px;\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Resource</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-IN; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Sports Development Expert</span></p>', 66, 220000.00, 220000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 158400.00, 5.00, 51920.00, 1090320.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-08-25', '2026-12-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1381, 0, 307, 3581, 769, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-25', NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 6, 5, '', '(1-3 years)', 0, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat;\">Minimum Educational Qualification of the Proposed resource shall be B. Arch/ M. Arch/</span>Equivalent Graduation in civil Engineering <span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat;\">from any recognised university</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Montserrat;\">3+ years of experience in designing and delivering Sports Infrastructure works for State/ Central Government departments</span></p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 4, '<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-IN\">Resource</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-IN\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 107%; font-family: Montserrat; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Sports Architect</span></p>', 66, 220000.00, 220000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 158400.00, 5.00, 51920.00, 1090320.00, 0, NULL, 0, 2, '2026-08-25', '2026-12-24', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1382, 0, 262, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 4, 5, '', '(1-3 years)', 0, '<p>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;B.E./B.Tech in Civil Engineering / B.Arch from recognized University/Institute.&nbsp;<br>&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; Minimum &nbsp;years experience in design, estimation, execution and supervision of civil engineering projects.<br>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Minimum 3 years experience in government infrastructure projects. &nbsp;<br>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Proficient in AutoCAD.&nbsp;<br>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Expertise in Environment Conservation, Watershed &amp; Natural Resource Management, Infrastructure Development, Urban &amp; Town Planning, Irrigation, Water Harvesting.</p>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp;Assess infrastructure requirements.<br>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp; Review DMF-funded infrastructure projects.&nbsp;<br>&bull; &nbsp; &nbsp; Review DPRs, BOQs, drawings, feasibility reports.<br>&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Coordinate with line departments.<br>&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Ensure compliance with approved designs.<br>&bull;&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Assist in bill verification and fund release.</p>', 152, 231000.00, 231000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 253638.00, 5.00, 83136.90, 1745874.90, 0, NULL, 0, 4, '2026-07-06', '2027-01-05', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1383, 0, 308, 3870, 770, '100500710', 'Suman Ghosh', '8974066003', 'suman.y.ghosh@pwc.com', '2026-08-30', '2026-09-07', 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 2, '', '(7+ years)', 0, '<p dir=\"ltr\">Educational Qualification</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">B.E./B.Tech in Computer Science, Information Technology, Electronics &amp; Communication, or equivalent.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Cybersecurity certifications such as CISSP, CISM, ISO 27001 Lead Implementer/Auditor, or equivalent are preferred.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Experience</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 10 years of overall IT experience.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 7 years in Cyber Security projects.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience of managing at least three (3) projects involving SOC/SIEM/Security Operations/Cyber Security for Government, PSU, BFSI, or large enterprises.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in preparing RFPs, bid evaluation, contract management, and project governance.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in stakeholder management involving multiple departments.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in cloud security and Security Operations is desirable.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Team Lead / Cyber Security Project Manager</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Roles &amp; Responsibilities</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Bid Process Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prepare DPR, RFP, technical specifications, eligibility criteria, SLAs, and evaluation methodology.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support pre-bid meetings and bidder clarifications.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in technical evaluation and demonstration.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support contract finalization and project kick-off.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Project Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Overall project planning and execution.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Monitor implementation milestones.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review project deliverables.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct steering committee meetings.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ensure adherence to timelines.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Vendor performance monitoring.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">SLA compliance monitoring.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Risk management.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Escalation management.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Monthly project review.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>', 134, 378000.00, 378000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 415044.00, 5.00, 136042.20, 2856886.20, 0, NULL, 0, 4, '2026-08-30', '2027-02-28', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1384, 0, 308, 3871, 771, '101770261', 'Shivam Deepak Bhagat', '9822227066', 'shivam.bhagat@pwc.com', '2026-08-30', '2026-09-09', 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 3, '', '(5+ years)', 0, '<p dir=\"ltr\">Educational Qualification</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">B.E./B.Tech in Computer Science, IT, Electronics, Cyber Security, or equivalent.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Certifications such as CEH, CISSP, GCIA, GCIH, Splunk, QRadar, Sentinel, Palo Alto, Fortinet, Microsoft Security, or equivalent are desirable.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Experience</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 8 years of experience in Information Security.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 5 years in SOC implementation/operation.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in implementation of at least two (2) Managed SOC/SIEM projects.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in cloud security (AWS/Azure/GCP/NIC Cloud).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in Vulnerability Assessment &amp; Penetration Testing (VAPT).&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience with XDR/EDR, SOAR, Threat Intelligence, WAF, IAM, and Endpoint Security solutions.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 6, '<p><strong>Cyber Security Technical Expert (SOC)<br><br></strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Roles &amp; Responsibilities</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Technical Support during Bid</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Define technical specifications.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prepare BoQ.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Finalize sizing of SIEM/EPS.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review OEM specifications.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Evaluate technical bids.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Implementation Support</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review architecture.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Validate integration with:&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Firewalls&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">IDS/IPS&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">WAF&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Servers&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Cloud platforms&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Applications&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Databases&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Active Directory&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Endpoint Security&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"3\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Security Governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review use cases.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Validate correlation rules.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Monitor SOC maturity.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review threat intelligence.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review incident response procedures.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"4\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Compliance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ensure compliance with:&nbsp;</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">CERT-In Directions&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">ISO 27001&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">MeitY Cyber Security Guidelines&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">State Cyber Security Policy&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">DPDP Act (where applicable)&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>', 135, 336000.00, 336000.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 368928.00, 5.00, 120926.40, 2539454.40, 0, NULL, 0, 4, '2026-08-30', '2027-02-28', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1385, 0, 308, 3872, 772, '101213137', 'Nirmalendu Ray', '9434983287', 'nirmalendu.r.ray@pwc.com', '2026-08-30', '2026-09-07', 0, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 1, 1, 4, '', '(3+ years)', 0, '<p dir=\"ltr\">Educational Qualification</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">MBA/PGDM/PGDBM/PGDM (Finance/Operations/IT) or B.E./B.Tech.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Certification in Procurement or Project Management is desirable.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Experience</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Minimum 5 years of experience in IT procurement and PMO.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in handling Government procurement under GFR, GeM, or State Procurement Rules.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in at least three (3) ICT procurement projects.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in bid management, contract management, and project documentation.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'PART TIME', 0, 6, '<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Procurement Specialist</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">Roles &amp; Responsibilities</p>\r\n<ol>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Bid Process</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prepare procurement schedules.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Publish tender documents.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Coordinate pre-bid meetings.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Manage bidder queries.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prepare corrigenda.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Coordinate bid opening.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support technical and financial evaluation.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Prepare evaluation reports.&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol start=\"2\">\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Contract Management</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Monitor contractual obligations.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Process invoices.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Track penalties and SLA compliance.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support change requests.&nbsp;</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Maintain risk and issue registers.</li>\r\n</ul>', 136, 288750.00, 288750.00, 0.00, 0.00, 18.00, 317047.50, 5.00, 103921.13, 2182343.63, 0, NULL, 0, 4, '2026-08-30', '2027-02-28', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
(1386, 0, 309, 3855, 773, 'EM-164', 'Rahul Singh Parmar', '9111888018', 'rsp893@gmail.com', '2026-08-23', '2026-09-02', 0, 'Active', NULL, NULL, 0, 0, NULL, 2, 0, 0, 'Assistant Technical Manager', '10+ Years', 10, '<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">At least Minimum of 10 years of experience in solution architecture, system integration, and project management.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Experience with Aadhaar authentication and KYC processes is highly desirable.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Experience of project management for state &ndash;wide e-Governance delivery project.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Should have a knowledge and experience of IT service delivery and project execution.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Knowledge of executing IT Projects Min 10 Years</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Strong programming skills in languages such as Java, or similar.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Experience with integration platforms and middleware technologies.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ability to integrate diverse systems, applications, and services seamlessly.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Deep understanding of cybersecurity principles and best practices.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Experience implementing security protocols and compliance measures.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Knowledge of database management systems (e.g., SQL, NoSQL).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Strong leadership and team management capabilities.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Exceptional analytical and problem-solving skills.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ability to diagnose issues quickly and propose effective solutions.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Experience in project management, including planning, execution, and monitoring.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Familiarity with project management tools and methodologies.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Flexibility to adapt to changing project requirements and priorities.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\" style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Ability to align technical solutions with organizational goals.</span></li>\r\n</ul>', 'FULL TIME', 0, 12, '<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: medium;\"><strong>Key Responsibilities</strong><br>&bull; Overall ownership of technical architecture and solution design<br>&bull; Oversight of development, integration, and deployment<br>&bull; Technology stack finalization and performance optimization<br>&bull; Ensuring security, scalability, and compliance<br>&bull; Technical issue resolution and code quality review<br>&bull; Coordination with development teams and System Integrator (SI)</span></p>', 124, 104976.00, 104976.00, 10.00, 127020.96, 18.00, 251501.50, 0.00, 0.00, 1648732.06, 0, NULL, 0, 3, '2026-09-02', '2027-09-01', 0, NULL, 0, 0),
