(377, 131, 'anyother', '<p><strong>4. Duration and Resource Deployment Plan for the Assignment<br></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The duration of the assignment is 12 months from the date of work order. The duration of the project may be extended based on agreement between the selected consulting firm and Department of Good Governance and Convergence, Government of Chhattisgarh.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>5. Indicative Minimum Eligibility Criteria</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The above qualifications/experience are <strong>indicative minimums</strong> consistent with the <strong>AMP DPR </strong>functions (data governance, KPI rationalization, technical coordination with SI, capacity building, review enablement, workflows, security/compliance). DoGGC may verify original documents/certifications at the time of interview/selection<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '<p><strong>5.1. Duration and Resource Deployment Plan for the Assignment<br></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The duration of the assignment is 12 months from the date of work order. The duration of the project may be extended based on agreement between the selected consulting firm and Department of Good Governance and Convergence, Government of Chhattisgarh.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>5.2. Indicative Minimum Eligibility Criteria</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The above qualifications/experience are <strong>indicative minimums</strong> consistent with the <strong>AMP DPR </strong>functions (data governance, KPI rationalization, technical coordination with SI, capacity building, review enablement, workflows, security/compliance). DoGGC may verify original documents/certifications at the time of interview/selection<strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>', '2026-03-24 16:32:33', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
