(385, 135, 'termsandcondition', '<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to the selected firm for the audit of <strong>Please provide project name</strong>, CHiPS, Government of Chhattisgarh, will be released upon submission of the invoice and corresponding deliverables on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>Each payment will be made only after the delivery of the corresponding deliverable and its acceptance by CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li>Taxes will be applicable as per prevailing government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>PENALTY TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025, Raipur dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following <span class=\"s1\">schedule.</span></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\"><span class=\"s2\">For reasons beyond the control of</span> <span class=\"s2\">the selected bidder</span> <span class=\"s2\">or CHiPS, as</span> <span class=\"s2\">the case may</span> <span class=\"s2\">be, selected </span><span class=\"s3\">bidder </span>shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-04-02 22:17:39', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
