(392, 136, 'termsandcondition', '<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to the selected firm for the audit of <strong>Please provide project name</strong>, CHiPS, Government of Chhattisgarh, will be released upon submission of the invoice and corresponding deliverables on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on a quarterly basis.</li>\r\n<li>Each payment will be made only after the delivery of the corresponding deliverable and its acceptance by CHiPS.</li>\r\n<li>Taxes will be applicable as per prevailing government norms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>PENALTY TERMS</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the terms and conditions mentioned in Tender No. 165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/Consultancy Firm/2025, Raipur dated 20/02/2025.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Payment terms</strong> <br>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule.</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n<li>For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.</li>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for technical support to the Department of Water Resources, Government of Chhattisgarh be released on man month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment. The payment will be as per current resources man month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><br>Penalty terms <br></strong>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</p>', '2026-04-03 17:52:46', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
