lass=\"p8\"><strong>2.1 Months 13&ndash;15: Scaleup Planning</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.2 Planning</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Preparation of Year2 Annual Action Plan based on Year1 learning</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Refinement of cluster and value chain strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.3 Agriculture &amp; Livelihoods Interventions</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Expand clusters and crop value chains across more villages</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Scale FPO strengthening interventions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.4 Months 16&ndash;18: Intensive Implementation - Crop &amp; Allied Value Chains</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Support aggregation, storage, primary processing</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Link FPOs with buyers, processors, input suppliers</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Promote animal husbandry / dairy linkages where relevant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.4 Women &amp; Nutrition</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Scale nutrition gardens</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Integrate with ICDS, Poshan Abhiyaan, NRLM etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.5 DMF Implementation</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Ongoing support on implementation</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Coordination with departments for convergence funding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol class=\"ol1\">\r\n<ol class=\"ol1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\"><strong>Months 19&ndash;21: Systems Maturation</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.2.1 Monitoring &amp; MIS</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Operationalize realtime MIS reporting</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Outcome and performance dashboards for DMFT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.2.2 Financial &amp; Compliance</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Strengthen procurement, fund utilisation, audit readiness</li>\r\