(480, 151, 'anyother', '<p class=\"p1\"><strong>5.1 Deployment of additional Resources/Technical Expert/Subject Matter Expert (SMEs)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">The Consultant will be based at the Head Office of the Excise Department, with field visits to districts or&nbsp;warehouses as required. The consultant shall work closely with senior departmental officials, including the&nbsp;Excise Commissioner or their designated representative.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>5.2 Duration of the Assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The initial engagement shall be for a period of 12 months, extendable based on performance and departmental&nbsp;requirement.</p>', '<p class=\"p1\"><strong>5.1 Deployment of additional Resources/Technical Expert/Subject Matter Expert (SMEs)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\">The Consultant will be based at the Head Office of the Excise Department, with field visits to districts or&nbsp;warehouses as required. The consultant shall work closely with senior departmental officials, including the&nbsp;Excise Commissioner or their designated representative.<br><br></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\"><strong>5.2 Duration of the Assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">The initial engagement shall be for a period of 12 months, extendable based on performance and departmental&nbsp;requirement.<br><br><strong>5.3 Deployment of Teams&nbsp;</strong><br>The selected consultant shall deploy the required key personnel within 30 days of the issue of the work order.</p>', '2026-05-03 15:52:40', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
