(577, 160, 'anyother', '<p dir=\"ltr\">Duration and Resource Deployment Plan for the Assignment</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The selected consultant shall deploy the required key personnel as per the RFP within the 30 days of issue of the work order. Initial Contract Period for the project shall be 24 months which is extendable for next 24 Months based on the performance of the consultant and approval from the competent authority.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>', '<p dir=\"ltr\"><strong>Duration and Resource Deployment Plan for the Assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The selected consultant shall deploy the required key personnel as per the RFP within the 30 days of issue of the work order. Initial Contract Period for the project shall be 24 months which is extendable for next 24 Months based on the performance of the consultant and approval from the competent authority.</p>', '2026-05-06 14:52:42', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
