leup Planning</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.2 Planning</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Preparation of Year2 Annual Action Plan based on Year1 learning</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Refinement of cluster and value chain strategies</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.3 Agriculture &amp; Livelihoods Interventions</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Expand clusters and crop value chains across more villages</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Scale FPO strengthening interventions</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.4 Months 16&ndash;18: Intensive Implementation - Crop &amp; Allied Value Chains</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Support aggregation, storage, primary processing</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Link FPOs with buyers, processors, input suppliers</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Promote animal husbandry / dairy linkages where relevant</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.4 Women &amp; Nutrition</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Scale nutrition gardens</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Integrate with ICDS, Poshan Abhiyaan, NRLM etc</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.1.5 DMF Implementation</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Ongoing support on implementation</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Coordination with departments for convergence funding</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<ol class=\"ol1\">\r\n<ol class=\"ol1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\"><strong>Months 19&ndash;21: Systems Maturation</strong></li>\r\n</ol>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.2.1 Monitoring &amp; MIS</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Operationalize realtime MIS reporting</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Outcome and performance dashboards for DMFT</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.2.2 Financial &amp; Compliance</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Strengthen procurement, fund utilisation, audit readiness</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.2.3 Strategic Advisory</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Support Trust Board and Executive Committee</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Midterm strategic review of activities</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.3 Months 22&ndash;24: MidTerm Review</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.3.1 Evaluation</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Midterm evaluation of agri, livelihood and nutrition outcomes</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Gender and inclusion assessment</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>2.3.2 Knowledge Management</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Best practice documentation</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Crosslearning workshops across blocks</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p7\"><strong>YEAR 3: SUSTAINABILITY, INSTITUTIONALISATION &amp; EXIT READINESS (Months 25&ndash;36)</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.1 Months 25&ndash;27: Sustainability Design</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.1.2 Planning</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Preparation of Year3 Annual Action Plan</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Sustainability and exit planning for clusters and FPOs</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.1.3 Agriculture &amp; Livelihoods</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Strengthening secondline leaders in FPOs</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Market diversification and risk mitigation support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.2 Months 28&ndash;30: Institutional Strengthening</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.2.1 FPOs &amp; Community Institutions</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Advanced governance, financial management training</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Facilitate access to credit, insurance, and longerterm contracts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.2.3 DMF Systems</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Institutionalize MIS, reporting and compliance protocols</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Capacity building of DMFT staff and district teams</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.3 Months 31&ndash;33: Outcome Consolidation</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.3.1 Impact Focus</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Focus on income enhancement, productivity, nutrition outcomes</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Support replication of successful models in uncovered areas</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.3.2 Governance Support</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Advisory support to longterm DMF strategy</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.4 Months 34&ndash;36: Final Review &amp; Transition</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.4.1 Evaluation &amp; Reporting</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Endline / outcome assessment</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Documentation of 3year impact</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.4.2 Knowledge &amp; Handover</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Comprehensive knowledge repository</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Toolkits, SOPs, and manuals for DMFT</li>\r\n<li class=\"li8\">Handover and transition support</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"p8\"><strong>3.4.3 Additional Responsibilities</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li11\">Execute any other tasks assigned\\</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Change Management</strong></p>\r\n<ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The selected consulting firm shall preferably give 2 weeks of advance notice to clients for any change in deployed resource during the assignment.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The selected consulting firm needs to ensure that the knowledge transfer and handover during change of any resource for a smooth transition.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li2\">The replacement of any resource should be approved by the client.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li3\">The change of resource should be in accordance to Tender No165081/CEO/CHiPS/Empanelment/ Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, dated 20/02/2025 issued by Chhattisgarh Infotech and Biotech Promotion Society for &ldquo;Empanelment of Consultancy Firms for a period of 3 years&rdquo; and amendments thereof.</li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-05-07 16:08:42', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
(589, 147, 'termsandcondition', '<p><strong>Payment terms&nbsp;</strong><br>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule. <br>&bull; The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms. <br>&bull; For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Penalty Terms </strong><br>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms. &nbsp;</p>', '<p><strong>Payment terms&nbsp;</strong><br>Payment to selected bidder for the scope of work done will be released as per the following schedule. <br>&bull; The successful bidder shall submit the invoice for payment on man month basis as per the agreed empanelment terms. <br>&bull; For reasons beyond the control of the selected bidder or CHiPS, as the case may be selected bidder shall be paid the requisite man month payment in the event that selected bidder has performed on its obligations in compliance with the terms of this contract.&nbsp;<br><br><strong>Penalty Terms </strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"p1\">Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms. Note: All other terms and conditions of 165081/CEO/CHiPS/ Empanelment/Consultancy Firms/2025 Raipur, Dated 20/02/2025<strong>, </strong>applicable to this EoI.</p>', '2026-05-07 17:19:25', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
