(669, 170, 'anyother', '<p><strong>Duration of the assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p>The consultancy team shall be engaged for an initial period of thirty-six (36) months, with the option for extension based on mutual agreement. The consultants will be onboarded through the CHiPS empanelment process.<br><br></p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for technical and operational support be released on person month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment.</li>\r\n<li>The payment will be as per current resources person month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement</li>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p><strong>Duration of the assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p>The consultancy team shall be engaged for an initial period of thirty-six (36) months, with the option for extension based on mutual agreement. The consultants will be onboarded through the CHiPS empanelment process.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for technical and operational support be released on person month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment.</li>\r\n<li>The payment will be as per current resources person month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement</li>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-06-12 17:02:50', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
