(714, 177, 'anyother', '<p><strong>1. Engagement Period </strong></p>\r\n<p>The envisaged duration of the assignment is 12 calendar months (1 year). The duration may be extended further as per the project need.</p>\r\n<p><strong>2. Key Deliverables </strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Inception Report</li>\r\n<li>Baseline Assessment Report</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder Consultation Report</li>\r\n<li>Draft Vision Document</li>\r\n<li>Final Vision Document</li>\r\n<li>Implementation Roadmap</li>\r\n<li>Presentations and Review Notes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3. KPIs</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Timely submission of deliverables.</li>\r\n<li>Quality of reports.</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder consultation coverage.</li>\r\n<li>Acceptance of Vision Document by District Administration.</li>\r\n<li>Support during implementation planning.</li>\r\n</ul>', '<p><strong>4. Engagement Period&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p>The envisaged duration of the assignment is 12 calendar months (1 year). The duration may be extended further as per the project need.</p>\r\n<p><strong>5. Key Deliverables&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Inception Report</li>\r\n<li>Baseline Assessment Report</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder Consultation Report</li>\r\n<li>Draft Vision Document</li>\r\n<li>Final Vision Document</li>\r\n<li>Implementation Roadmap</li>\r\n<li>Presentations and Review Notes</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>6. KPIs</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Timely submission of deliverables.</li>\r\n<li>Quality of reports.</li>\r\n<li>Stakeholder consultation coverage.</li>\r\n<li>Acceptance of Vision Document by District Administration.</li>\r\n<li>Support during implementation planning.</li>\r\n</ul>', '2026-07-15 16:13:22', 1, 'ADMIN', 1, 0),
