(17, 118, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Position changed from Consultant to Associate Consultant.<br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">U.G. degree in Social Work/ Social Sciences/ Disability Studies/Public Policy, or related fields from the renowned institutions/ any UGC recognized University. Preferences may be given to candidates from reputed institutions such as TISS, AMU, BHU, University of Lucknow or other recognized institutions of repute.</span></p> to <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">U.G. degree in Social Work/ Social Sciences/ Disability Studies/Public Policy, or related fields from the renowned institutions/ any UGC recognized University. Preferences may be given to candidates from reputed institutions such as TISS, AMU, BHU, University of Lucknow or other recognized institutions of repute.</span></p>.<br>on 12-02-2026, 04:38 PM', '2026-02-12 16:38:28', 99, 1, '2026-02-12 18:06:28', 1),
(18, 118, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Position changed from Consultant to Associate Consultant.<br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">U.G. degree in Social Work/ Social Sciences/ Disability Studies/Public Policy, or related fields from the renowned institutions/ any UGC recognized University. Preferences may be given to candidates from reputed institutions such as TISS, AMU, BHU, University of Lucknow or other recognized institutions of repute.</span></p> to <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 150%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\">U.G. degree in Social Work/ Social Sciences/ Disability Studies/Public Policy, or related fields from the renowned institutions/ any UGC recognized University. Preferences may be given to candidates from reputed institutions such as TISS, AMU, BHU, University of Lucknow or other recognized institutions of repute.</span></p>.<br>on 12-02-2026, 04:39 PM', '2026-02-12 16:39:08', 99, 1, '2026-02-12 18:06:21', 1),
(19, 119, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Remark changed from <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum 7+ years of relevant experience in development sector / government advisory / large programme management. </span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">At least 5 years in leadership/Team Lead role in government projects, externally aided projects, or district/state-level missions.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Provide overall leadership and strategic direction to the PMU.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Coordinate with district administration, line departments, and other stakeholders.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Oversee planning, implementation, and monitoring of DMF-funded interventions across sectors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Ensure alignment of projects with DMF guidelines, district priorities, and statutory frameworks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Conceptualize a wide range of innovative projects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Guide preparation of annual action plans, budgets, and progress reports.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Review outputs from sector experts and ensure convergence and coherence across components.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Support decision-making, risk management, and issue resolution at the district level. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Represent the PMU in review meetings, workshops, and consultations.</span></p> to <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum 7+ years of relevant experience in development sector / government advisory / large programme management.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">At least 5 years in leadership/Team Lead role in government projects, externally aided projects, or district/state-level missions.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in multi-sector project planning, convergence, and monitoring.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Strong experience in stakeholder coordination with district administration and line departments.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in preparing action plans, DPR review, budgeting, and reporting.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Project Specific Requirements:&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Provide overall leadership and strategic direction to the PMU.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Coordinate with district administration, line departments, and other stakeholders.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Oversee planning, implementation, and monitoring of DMF-funded interventions across sectors.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\">Ensure alignment of projects with DMF guidelines, district priorities, and statutory frameworks.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-indent: -13.5pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; margin: 2.4pt 0cm .0001pt 17.05pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&