nd consultations.</span></p>.<br>on 13-02-2026, 05:30 PM', '2026-02-13 17:30:39', 102, 1, '2026-02-13 18:30:13', 1),
(20, 119, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">M.Tech (Civil), Master&rsquo;s in Urban Planning / Rural Planning / Infrastructure Planning / Water Resources Engineering.</span></p> to <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">M.Tech (Civil), Master’s in Urban Planning / Rural Planning / Infrastructure Planning / Water Resources Engineering.</span></p>.<br>Remark changed from <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience</span></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum&nbsp;5+ years in infrastructure planning, DPR preparation, irrigation systems, and civil works supervision.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in urban and rural infrastructure projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of government tendering and project monitoring systems.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in reviewing cost estimates and quality assurance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Project<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.55pt;\"> </span>Specific <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Requirements</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess urban and rural infrastructure and planning requirements under DMF, including irrigation and water-related development needs.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning, design, and review of DMF-funded urban development, rural infrastructure, and irrigation projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for urban planning, rural spatial planning, land-use planning, and sustainable settlement development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and development of irrigation systems, including minor irrigation, water resource management, and agricultural water-use efficiency.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Review Detailed Project Reports (DPRs), cost estimates, designs, and implementation plans for urban, rural, and irrigation projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in monitoring, reporting, and documentation of project progress, quality, and outcomes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with line departments, Urban Local Bodies, Panchayati Raj Institutions, Water Resources Department, and other stakeholders to ensure effective convergence and implementation.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Support integration of sustainability, climate resilience, and disaster risk considerations into planning and infrastructure projects.</span></p> to <p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum&nbsp;5+ years in infrastructure planning, DPR preparation, irrigation systems, and civil works supervision.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in urban and rural infrastructure projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of government tendering and project monitoring systems.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in reviewing cost estimates and quality assurance.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Project<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.55pt;\"> </span>Specific <span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\">Requirements:</span></span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess urban and rural infrastructure and planning requirements under DMF, including irrigation and water-related development needs.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning, design, and review of DMF-funded urban development, rural infrastructure, and irrigation projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for urban planning, rural spatial planning, land-use planning, and sustainable settlement development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and development of irrigation systems, including minor irrigation, water resource management, and agricultural water-use efficiency.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Review Detailed Project Reports (DPRs), cost estimates, designs, and implementation plans for urban, rural, and irrigation projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in monitoring, reporting, and documentation of project progress, quality, and outcomes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with line departments, Urban Local Bodies, Panchayati Raj Institutions, Water Resources Department, and other stakeholders to ensure effective convergence and implementation.</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Support integration of sustainability, climate resilience, and disaster risk considerations into planning and infrastructure projects.</span></p>.<br>on 13-02-2026, 05:30 PM', '2026-02-13 17:30:59', 102, 1, '2026-02-13 18:30:39', 1),
(21, 119, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Remark changed from <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in MIS development, dashboard design, and data management systems.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in government MIS platforms or development sector projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Strong knowledge of database management, analytics tools, and dashboard development (Power BI/Tableau etc.).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-