(23, 119, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Remark changed from <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum 5+<strong> years</strong> in agriculture and allied sector development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in farmer producer organizations (FPOs), agri-value chains, livestock development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in convergence with agriculture department schemes.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of climate-resilient agriculture practices.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Project Specific Requirement:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess agricultural practices, constraints, and potential in DMF/mining-affected areas.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of agriculture, horticulture, fisheries, and animal husbandry projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Promote sustainable, climate-resilient, and resource-efficient farming practices.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical guidance on animal husbandry and livestock development, including breed improvement, veterinary support, fodder development, and dairy/poultry/livestock-based livelihoods.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support horticulture development, including high-value crops, orchards, kitchen gardens, nursery development, and post-harvest management.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate convergence with Agriculture, Horticulture, Fisheries, Animal Husbandry, and allied departments.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for crop diversification, productivity enhancement, value addition, and agri-enterprise development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Monitor progress and outcomes of agriculture and allied sector interventions and recommend corrective measures. <span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Support farmer outreach, capacity building, demonstrations, training programs, and documentation of best practices and results.</span></span></p> to <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum 5+<strong> years</strong> in agriculture and allied sector development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in farmer producer organizations (FPOs), agri-value chains, livestock development.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in convergence with agriculture department schemes.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of climate-resilient agriculture practices.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Project Specific Requirements:</span></strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assess agricultural practices, constraints, and potential in DMF/mining-affected areas.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of agriculture, horticulture, fisheries, and animal husbandry projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Promote sustainable, climate-resilient, and resource-efficient farming practices.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical guidance on animal husbandry and livestock development, including breed improvement, veterinary support, fodder development, and dairy/poultry/livestock-based livelihoods.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support horticulture development, including high-value crops, orchards, kitchen gardens, nursery development, and post-harvest management.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Facilitate convergence with Agriculture, Horticulture, Fisheries, Animal Husbandry, and allied departments.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical inputs for crop diversification, productivity enhancement, value addition, and agri-enterprise development.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Monitor progress and outcomes of agriculture and allied sector interventions and recommend corrective measures. <span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Support farmer outreach, capacity building, demonstrations, training programs, and documentation of best practices and results.</span></span></p>.<br>on 13-02-2026, 05:32 PM', '2026-02-13 17:32:50', 102, 1, '2026-02-13 18:29:46', 1),
(24, 119, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Master&rsquo;s in Environmental Science / Environmental Engineering / Urban Planning or equivalent.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p> to <p><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Master’s in Environmental Science / Environmental Engineering / Urban Planning or equivalent.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">  </span></span></p>.<br>Remark changed from <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in environmental management, pollution control, WASH, or housing projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in DPR preparation and environmental safeguards.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of mining-related environmental impacts (Desirable).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in coordination with Pollution Control Board / Environment Department.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;Project Specific Requirements:</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support integration of environmental sustainability and safeguards in DMF planning and project implementation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Provide technical advice on environmentally sustainable practices in infrastructure, mining-affected area restoration, and community projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support planning and implementation of drinking water supply interventions, including centralized purification systems, water treatment plants, piped water supply networks, and standalone drinking water facilities.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in environment preservation and pollution control measures, including effluent treatment plants, control of air and dust pollution, mine drainage systems, mine pollution prevention technologies, and protection of surface and groundwater sources.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support identification of mineral-specific pollutants and environmental hazards, including collaboration with research and technical institutions, and implementation of air quality monitoring systems.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Assist in planning and implementation of sanitation initiatives, including solid and liquid waste management, drainage systems, sewage treatment plants, fecal sludge management, public toilet facilities, and cleanliness drives.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support housing interventions, including provision of pucca housing for mining-affected people not covered under Central or State schemes.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Draft and review Terms of Reference (ToRs), DPRs, and technical proposals related to environmental protection, water, sanitation, and housing projects.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Coordinate with Forest, Mining, Environment, Urban Development, and allied departments to ensure convergence and regulatory compliance.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support awareness generation, community engagement, and capacity building on environmental protection, water conservation, sanitation, and sustainable development. <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Monitor project implementation, track environmental outcomes, and recommend corrective actions where required.</span></p> to <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-outline-level: 3;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience:</span></strong></p>\r\n<ul type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Minimum <strong>5+ years</strong> in environmental management, pollution control, WASH, or housing projects.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in DPR preparation and environmental safeguards.</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Knowledge of mining-related environmental impacts (Desirable).</span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">Experience in coordination with Pollution Control Board / Environment Department.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: .0001pt; line-height: normal;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',\'serif\'; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-fareast-language: EN-IN;\">&nbsp;<strong>Project Specific Requirements:</strong></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Support integration of environmental sustainability and safeguards in DMF planning and project implementation.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 14.2pt; text-indent: -11.35pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\