 \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Authority intends to take-up development projects (infrastructure/buildings) as per the developed Master Plan/ Development Plan/ Vision Framework. The consultants shall advise and assist the Authority in getting the following activities done:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo12; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Physical survey, infrastructure survey, topographical surveys</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo12; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Preparation of project structure, nature of project, composition, conceptual design</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo12; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-