e in Sirpur Special Area.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assisting the authority in analysing the project specific requirements for development of projects on land parcels, by formulating an efficient process. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">For making the land allotment process efficient, assistance to authority in properly defining the process of application and decision. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l13 level1 lfo6; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assistances in benchmarking of national and international best practices of Regulations regarding various aspects of development.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -36.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level3 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.2<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Additional Scope of work: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">The Authority may also ask the Consultant to execute the work defined in clause 4.1.2.1 to 4.1.2.4, if required and on mutual agreement between the parties, additional manpower shall be deployed to execute such work as per the terms and conditions of this Tender document and rates discovered under this Tender document.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLi