e-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assistances in benchmarking of national and international best practices of Regulations regarding various aspects of development.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 3.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -36.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level3 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 54.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.2<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Additional Scope of work: </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 49.65pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">The Authority may also ask the Consultant to execute the work defined in clause 1.1.2.1 to 1.1.2.4, if required and on mutual agreement between the parties, additional manpower shall be deployed to execute such work as per the terms and conditions of this Tender document and rates discovered under this Tender document.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-al