mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority in evaluating concessionaire&rsquo;s financial models for achievement of financial closure in case of PPP Projects.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority in commencement of building strategic relationships with all stakeholders and other authority officials associated with the project.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority in managing public communication activities as required.<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">e)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority in planning contract Management practices.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -17.85pt; line-height: 112%; mso-list: l11 level1 lfo7; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 70.85pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 112%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority in planning resource management plan of in-house resources, whose responsibilities are associated with the project as required.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; line-height: 111%; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -54.0pt; line-height: normal; mso-list: l7 level4 lfo1; margin: 0cm 0cm 12.0pt 72.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.1.2.2<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri;\">Media/Marketing, Operating Procedure (SOP) for Departments of SSADA </span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Study shall be done to map out systems and procedures to be used in the Projects &amp; Finance Department of SSADA to ensure that the workflows are both efficient and economical in terms of time and labour. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">The SOP are expected to guide the operations of the SSADA and shall ensure a well thought out and standardized approach to workflows and prevailing policy and legislation that needs to be adhered to, both internally and externally. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">The setup of SOP shall include preparation of comprehensive set of standard documents and forms that can be used. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 111%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; margin: 0cm 0cm .25pt 70.9pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: black;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">d)<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; line-height: 111%; font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif;\">Assist authority to Develop knowledge content, brochures, digital campaign