: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" width=\"49\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">5.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 198.85pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Upgradation and 3 Years of O&amp;M of the ICCC</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Under tendering process</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 117.95pt; border-top: none; border-left: none; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-left-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"157\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">31.03.2030</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</tbody>\r\n</table>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18pt; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>The Project &ldquo;Digital City Platform Pilot Project&rdquo; is under extended O&amp;M Period and is likely to be completed by 31.03.2026. This Project was executed through NRANSCCL. <span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp;</span>A new RFP has been floated by NRANVP for Upgradation of the existing ICCC and further O&amp;M of the Project for 3 years. </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">The PMC team would be responsible for managing all the ICT Projects under NRANSCCL and the Upgradation Project of the ICCC under NRANVP.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left: 18.0pt; text-align: justify; line-height: 150%;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">The details of the ongoing Projects are mentioned below:</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l10 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Digital City Platform Pilot Project (ICCC Project phase I):</span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 54.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">a.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Project Start Date: April 2017</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 54.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">b.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Project End Date: July 2024</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 54.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 150%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">c.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Project extended Period: Till March 2026</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left: 54.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0