"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>condition<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.05pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\"> </span>the<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\"> </span>field devices during<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.05pt;\"> </span>Project Tenure.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 155%; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo3; tab-stops: 59.05pt; margin: 5.65pt 18.05pt .0001pt 49.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">f.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">The PMC shall be responsible for organizing regular project review meetings with the<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>Authority (NRANSCCL and NRANVP) along with the SI&rsquo;s for the smooth functioning of the<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.3pt;\"> </span>above<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\">-mentioned</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -.15pt;\"> </span>Projects.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 155%; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo3; tab-stops: 59.0pt; margin: 5.6pt 18.15pt .0001pt 49.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">g.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Provide necessary Project related information to NRANSCCL, MoHUA or any other<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>authorized<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.65pt;\"> </span>Agency<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.6pt;\"> </span>for<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.75pt;\"> </span>preparation<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.5pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.7pt;\"> </span>their<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.65pt;\"> </span>specific<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.7pt;\"> </span>reports<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.65pt;\"> </span>and<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.65pt;\"> </span>other<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.7pt;\"> </span>related<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.65pt;\"> </span>documents.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 155%; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo3; tab-stops: 59.0pt; margin: 5.75pt 18.1pt .0001pt 49.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">h.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">Provide necessary support to NRANSCCL on Cyber Security Audit and IMAF Audit of the ICCC from time to time as would be required by MoHUA, STQC, Quality Council of India, IB etc.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 155%; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo3; tab-stops: 59.0pt; margin: 5.75pt 18.1pt .0001pt 49.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">i.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">The PMC will be responsible for the preparation of the DPR and RFP of any new ICT Project that would be suggested by NRANSCCL followed by Bid Process Management, onboarding of the new SI and monitoring and Supervision of the Implementation and O&amp;M Phase of the Project.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 155%; mso-list: l0 level3 lfo3; tab-stops: 59.0pt; margin: 5.75pt 18.1pt .0001pt 49.65pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\';\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">j.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">The PMC shall assist NRANSCCL/NRANVP for end to end monitoring and supervision of the ICCC Upgradation Project during both the Implementation Phase and O&amp;M Phase of the said Project.</span></p> to <p class=\"p1\">As part of EOI, NRANSCCL wants to on board Project Management Consultants to perform following major activities but not limited to which includes managing Operations &amp; Maintenance Phase of the existing ICT Projects along with monitoring and supervision of the Upgradation Project of the ICCC under NRANVP and other Projects that would be identified by the Nava Raipur Atal Nagar SmartCity Corporation Limited.<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Activities to</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>be</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>performed</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>by</strong><span class=\"s2\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>the </strong><span class=\"s3\"><strong>PMC<br><br></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">a. Support the Client for monitoring compliance to the tender requirements of the Operations and Maintenance Phase of the aforementioned Projects.<br><br>b. Monitor the Operations and Maintenance of the aforementioned Projects as per the standards and requirements defined for SIs including but not limited to resolution of issues, availability of the system, updating hardware or system software etc.<br><br>c. Evaluation of the submitted SLA reports of the above-mentioned Projects by the SI&rsquo;s by randomly checking the data as submitted in the SLA reports along with monitoring the precision, accuracy and calibration of the sensors installed at site.<br><br>d. Preparation of SLA review Reports of the O&amp;M Phase, penalty calculation as per the Tender terms and conditions and preparation of the Milestone Verification Report of the above IT Projects for the O&amp;M Phase along with the Projects that would be under implementation Phase in accordance with the contractual obligations of the SI&rsquo;s.<br><br>e. Regular field visit during Implementation Phase and O&amp;M Phase (as would be applicable) to monitor the upkeep of all the IT assets which are a part of the abovementioned projects along with monitoring the health and physical condition of the field devices during Project Tenure.<br><br>f. The PMC shall be responsible for organizing regular project review meetings with the Authority (NRANSCCL and NRANVP) along with the SI&rsquo;s for the smooth functioning of the above-mentioned Projects.<br><br>g. Provide necessary Project related information to NRANSCCL, MoHUA or any other authorized Agency for preparation of their specific reports and other related documents.<br><br>h. Provide necessary support to NRANSCCL on Cyber Security Audit and IMAF Audit of the ICCC from time to time as would be required by MoHUA, STQC, Quality Council of India, IB etc.<br><br>i. The PMC will be responsible for the preparation of the DPR and RFP of any new ICT Project that would be suggested by NRANSCCL followed by Bid Process Management, onboarding of the new SI and monitoring and Supervision of the Implementation and O&amp;M Phase of the Project.<br><br>j. The PMC shall assist NRANSCCL/NRANVP for end to end monitoring and supervision of the ICCC Upgradation Project during both the Implementation Phase and O&amp;M Phase of the said Project</span><strong><br></strong></span></span></p><br>Special condition of contract changed from <h2 style=\"margin-left: 36pt; text-indent: -18pt; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc222145364;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">1.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Terms of Reference </span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc222145364;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">(TOR)</span></strong></span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.2pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 155%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various<span style=\"letter-spacing: .8pt;\"> </span>projects<span style=\"letter-spacing: .9pt;\"> </span>as<span style=\"letter-spacing: .75pt;\"> </span>mentioned<span style=\"letter-spacing: .7pt;\"> in this EOI document.</span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.45pt; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span><a name=\"_Toc222145365\"></a><a name=\"_TOC_250008\"></a><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc222145365;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">2.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Critical Information and Last Date for </span></strong></span><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc222145365;\"><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Response</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-top: 0.05pt; text-align: justify;\"><strong style=\"mso-bidi-font-weight: normal;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span></strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 155%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Bidding Consulting firms are advised to study this EoI document carefully before submitting<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>their proposals in response to this EoI Notice. Submission of a proposal in response to this<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>notice shall be deemed to have been done after careful study and examination of this<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>document<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>with<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\"> </span>a<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.35pt;\"> </span>full<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>understanding<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.1pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.2pt;\"> </span>its<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.25pt;\"> </span>terms,<span style=\"letter-spacing: -.15pt;\"> </span>conditions,<span style=