\'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: \'Times New Roman\'; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">10.<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Penalty terms</span></strong><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 14.0pt; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\"> </span></strong></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"margin-left: 18pt; line-height: 115%; text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif;\">&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Times New Roman\',serif; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Additional Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed current empanelment 2025 terms. </span></p> to <p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Terms of Reference (TOR)&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various projects as mentioned in section 4.</span><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. Duration of the Assignment<br></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various projects as mentioned in section 4.</span><br><br></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Change Management<br></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">a. The selected consulting firm needs to give two weeks of advance notice to NRANSCCL for any change of deployed resource during the assignment <br>b. The selected consulting firm needs to ensure that the knowledge transfer and handover during the change of any resource for a smooth transition <br>c. The replacement of any resource should be approved by NRANSCCL<br><br><strong>4. Deployment of Team<br></strong>The selected consultant shall deploy the required key personnel as per this EOI within the 15 days of issue of the work order.</span></p><br>', '2026-03-02 12:08:02', 110, 1, '2026-03-02 12:08:46', 1);
INSERT INTO `log_eoi_updates` (`recordid`, `requestid`, `particular`, `updatedon`, `updatedby`, `isviewed`, `viewedon`, `viewedby`) VALUES
(38, 124, 'Project objective changed from <p>As per the GoI guidelines, Nava Raipur Atal Nagar Vikas Pradhikaran has formed a separate Special Purpose Vehicle (SPV) as Nava Raipur Atal Nagar Smart City Corporation Limited (NRANSCCL) for the implementation of Smart Solution Projects under the smart city mission for the city of Nava Raipur Atal Nagar. The smart city proposal of Nava Raipur Atal Nagar includes several Pan City and Area Based Development initiatives with a focus on both infrastructure and ICT advancements across the city and at strategic locations. The strategic focus of the city has been identified to improve mobility, improve situational awareness, enhance public safety and security, and introduce data driven decision-making.<br><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>Objective and Background of the Projects under NRANSCCL<br><br></strong></span>NRANSCCL being a SPV of NRANVP are executing multiple ICT Projects under the Smart City Mission. These Projects are currently under the Operation and Maintenance Phase and will continue till the end of the O&amp;M Period. The details of the Projects are mentioned below:<br><br></p>\r\n<table style=\"height: 393px; width: 93.3846%;\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr>\r\n<td style=\"width: 3.0497%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Sl.</strong></span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>No.</strong></span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: 50.9029%;\" valign=\"top\">\r\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>Name</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong> </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: small;\"><strong>of</strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: Times New Roman; fo