(39, 124, 'Special condition of contract changed from <p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Terms of Reference (TOR)&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various projects as mentioned in section 4.</span><br><br><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. Duration of the Assignment<br></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various projects as mentioned in section 4.</span><br><br></span><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">3. Change Management<br></span></strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">a. The selected consulting firm needs to give two weeks of advance notice to NRANSCCL for any change of deployed resource during the assignment <br>b. The selected consulting firm needs to ensure that the knowledge transfer and handover during the change of any resource for a smooth transition <br>c. The replacement of any resource should be approved by NRANSCCL<br><br><strong>4. Deployment of Team<br></strong>The selected consultant shall deploy the required key personnel as per this EOI within the 15 days of issue of the work order.</span></p> to <p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>1. Terms of Reference (TOR)&nbsp;</strong></span><br><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultant team shall comprise highly competent professionals who would be working directly with NRANSCCL as PMC for assisting NRANSCCL in various projects.</span></p>\r\n<p><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">2. Duration of the Assignment</span></strong></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">The consultancy services shall initially be for 18 (eighteen) months and may be extended further for another 02 (Two)years based on the performa