(86, 126, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Master&rsquo;s Degree (or equivalent) in Management,&nbsp;Development&nbsp;Studies/Practice, Social&nbsp;Work, or related field(s) from&nbsp;a reputed&nbsp;National/International&nbsp;University/Institution.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum of 3 years of total work experience related to project management in private/public/not-for-profit sector.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum of 3 years of experience in implementation of government schemes/projects</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li> Master’s Degree (or equivalent) in Management, Development Studies/Practice, Social Work, or related field(s) from a reputed National/International University/Institution.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum of 3 years of total work experience related to project management in private/public/not-for-profit sector.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum of 3 years of experience in implementation of government schemes/projects</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from <p>team leader</p> to <p>&nbsp;He/she&nbsp; will be the&nbsp; team leader</p>\r\n<p> Responsible for overall&nbsp;<br>functioning of PMU. &nbsp;<br> Build and maintain high&nbsp;<br>performing team. &nbsp;<br> Manage human and financial&nbsp;<br>resources.&nbsp;<br> Ensure timely deliverables.&nbsp;<br> Conceptualise innovation&nbsp;<br>projects. &nbsp;<br> Act as formal&nbsp;<br>communication channel&nbsp;<br>between Agency and DMF. &nbsp;<br> Oversee planning,&nbsp;<br>implementation, monitoring. &nbsp;<br> Ensure alignment with DMF&nbsp;<br>guidelines and statutory&nbsp;<br>frameworks. &nbsp;<br> Guide preparation of action&nbsp;<br>plans, budgets, reports. &nbsp;<br> Support decision-making and&nbsp;<br>risk management</p>.<br>on 16-03-2026, 02:56 PM', '2026-03-16 14:56:20', 108, 1, '2026-03-16 15:13:49', 1);
