(87, 126, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Master&rsquo;s Degree (or equivalent) in Management,&nbsp;Development&nbsp;Studies/Practice, Social&nbsp;Work, or related field(s).</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3years experience in Health &amp; Nutrition management.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Minimum 3years experience in implementation of government schemes/projects.</li>\r\n<li>Expertise in Drinking Water,&nbsp;Sanitation, Healthcare,&nbsp;Hospital Administration,&nbsp;Nutrition, Women &amp; Child Development.</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li> Master’s Degree (or equivalent) in Management, Development Studies/Practice, Social Work, or related field(s).</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3years experience in Health & Nutrition management.</li>\r\n<li> Minimum 3years experience in implementation of government schemes/projects.</li>\r\n<li>Expertise in Drinking Water, Sanitation, Healthcare, Hospital Administration, Nutrition, Women & Child Development.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from  to <ul>\r\n<li>Support planning,<br>implementation and<br>monitoring of health<br>interventions</li>\r\n<li>Assess health and nutrition<br>needs.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in design and<br>prioritization of health<br>interventions.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Coordinate with health and<br>ICDS departments.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Provide technical inputs and<br>monitoring indicators.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Support capacity building<br>and reporting<br><br></li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 16-03-2026, 02:58 PM', '2026-03-16 14:58:07', 108, 1, '2026-03-16 15:13:41', 1),
