(89, 126, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./B.Tech in Civil&nbsp;Engineering / B.Arch from&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;University/Institute.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3 years experience in design, estimation, execution and supervision of civil engineering projects.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3 years experience in government infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li>Proficient in AutoCAD.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Expertise in Environment Conservation, Watershed &amp;&nbsp;Natural Resource&nbsp;Management, Infrastructure&nbsp;Development, Urban &amp; Town&nbsp;Planning, Irrigation, Water&nbsp;Harvesting.</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./B.Tech in Civil Engineering / B.Arch from recognized University/Institute.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3 years experience in design, estimation, execution and supervision of civil engineering projects.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3 years experience in government infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li>Proficient in AutoCAD.</li>\r\n<li> Expertise in Environment Conservation, Watershed & Natural Resource Management, Infrastructure Development, Urban & Town Planning, Irrigation, Water Harvesting.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from  to <ul>\r\n<li>Assess infrastructure<br>requirements</li>\r\n<li>Review DMF-funded<br>infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li>Review DPRs, BOQs,<br>drawings, feasibility reports.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Coordinate with line<br>departments.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure compliance with<br>approved designs.</li>\r\n<li>&nbsp;Assist in bill verification and<br>fund release</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 16-03-2026, 03:00 PM', '2026-03-16 15:00:40', 108, 1, '2026-03-16 15:09:55', 1),
