(92, 126, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Remark changed from <p>&nbsp;He/she&nbsp; will be the&nbsp; team leader</p>\r\n<p> Responsible for overall&nbsp;<br>functioning of PMU. &nbsp;<br> Build and maintain high&nbsp;<br>performing team. &nbsp;<br> Manage human and financial&nbsp;<br>resources.&nbsp;<br> Ensure timely deliverables.&nbsp;<br> Conceptualise innovation&nbsp;<br>projects. &nbsp;<br> Act as formal&nbsp;<br>communication channel&nbsp;<br>between Agency and DMF. &nbsp;<br> Oversee planning,&nbsp;<br>implementation, monitoring. &nbsp;<br> Ensure alignment with DMF&nbsp;<br>guidelines and statutory&nbsp;<br>frameworks. &nbsp;<br> Guide preparation of action&nbsp;<br>plans, budgets, reports. &nbsp;<br> Support decision-making and&nbsp;<br>risk management</p> to <p><strong>&nbsp;He/she will be the Team Leader</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Responsible for overall functioning of PMU.</li>\r\n<li>Build and maintain high performing team.</li>\r\n<li>Manage human and financial&nbsp;resources.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure timely deliverables.</li>\r\n<li>Conceptualise innovation projects.</li>\r\n<li>Act as formal communication channel between Agency and DMF.</li>\r\n<li>Oversee planning, implementation, monitoring.</li>\r\n<li>Ensure alignment with DMF guidelines and statutory frameworks.</li>\r\n<li>Guide preparation of action plans, budgets, reports.</li>\r\n<li>Support decision-making and risk management</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 16-03-2026, 03:38 PM', '2026-03-16 15:38:32', 108, 1, '2026-03-16 17:14:33', 1),
