s.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Strengthen evidencebased monitoring using drilldowns and performance analysis.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li4\">Support actiontracking arising from review meetings.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Provide M&amp;Ealigned insights for governance decisionmaking.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from <p class=\"p1\">Monitoring and Domain Specialist</p> to <p class=\"p1\">Monitoring Specialist</p>.<br>on 24-03-2026, 03:02 PM', '2026-03-24 15:02:52', 78, 1, '2026-03-24 15:15:42', 1),
