(120, 140, 'Special condition of contract changed from  to <p><strong>Duration</strong><span class=\"s1\"><strong> </strong></span><strong>of the</strong><span class=\"s2\"><strong> </strong></span><span class=\"s3\"><strong>Assignment</strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"p2\"><span class=\"s3\">The firm shall be engaged for a period of 03 Months, which may be extended further based on performance and approval of the competent authority.</span></p><br>', '2026-04-16 16:28:25', 112, 1, '2026-04-16 16:29:40', 1),
