(128, 147, 'Project objective changed from <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The key objective of engaging the resource is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the State Aviation Department in the following areas:</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;i. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Formulation of the State Aviation Policy including policy research, stakeholder consultations, benchmarking with national and global practices, and drafting.</span>&nbsp; </p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">ii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing end-to-end PMU support for:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Drafting of tenders (RFPs, RFQs, EOIs) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Procurement of goods and services </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Airport upgradation and infrastructure development activities </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Activities related to airports under Regional Connectivity Scheme (RCS) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Operationalisation and development of the New State Hangar</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;iii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Supporting the state in:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Effective implementation of aviation norms, rules, regulations, and industry best practices.</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of employment in the aviation sector, including pilot training, cabin crew training, and other aviation-related skill development initiatives.</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of aviation-related activities including Flying Training Organisations (FTOs).</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;iv. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Coordination with national level flying academies for training, capacity building, and expansion opportunities</span></p> to <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The key objective of engaging the resource is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the State Aviation Department in the following areas:</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;i. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Formulation of the State Aviation Policy including policy research, stakeholder consultations, benchmarking with national and global practices, and drafting.</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">ii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing end-to-end PMU support for:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Drafting of tenders (RFPs, RFQs, EOIs) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp; </span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Procurement of goods and services </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Airport upgradation and infrastructure development activities </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Activities related to airports under Regional Connectivity Scheme (RCS) </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Operationalisation and development of the New State Hangar</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;iii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Supporting the state in:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Effective implementation of aviation norms, rules, regulations, and industry best practices.</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of employment in the aviation sector, including pilot training, cabin crew training, and other aviation-related skill development initiatives.</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot; </span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of aviation-related activities including Flying Training Organisations (FTOs).</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;iv. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Coordination with national level flying academies for training, capacity building, and expansion opportunities</span></p><br>Scope of work changed from <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The key objective of engaging the resource is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the State Aviation Department in the following areas:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>i. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Formulation of the State Aviation Policy including policy research, stakeholder consultations, benchmarking with national and global practices, and drafting.</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; ii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing end-to-end PMU support for:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Drafting of tenders (RFPs, RFQs, EOIs)</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Procurement of goods and services</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Airport upgradation and infrastructure development activities</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Activities related to airports under Regional Connectivity Scheme (RCS)</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Operationalisation and development of the New State Hangar</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">iii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Supporting the state in:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Effective implementation of aviation norms, rules, regulations, and industry best practices.</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of employment in the aviation sector, including pilot training, cabin crew training, and other aviation-related skill development initiatives.</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of aviation-related activities including Flying Training Organisations (FTOs).</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">iv.&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Coordination with national level flying academies for training, capacity building, and expansion opportunities</span></p> to <p><span lang=\"EN-US\">The key objective of engaging the resource is to strengthen the institutional capacity of the State Aviation Department in the following areas:</span>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<br>i. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Formulation of the State Aviation Policy including policy research, stakeholder consultations, benchmarking with national and global practices, and drafting.</span></p>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">ii.&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Providing end-to-end PMU support for:</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Drafting of tenders (RFPs, RFQs, EOIs)</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Procurement of goods and services</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Airport upgradation and infrastructure development activities</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Activities related to airports under Regional Connectivity Scheme (RCS)</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Operationalisation and development of the New State Hangar</span><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">iii. </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Supporting the state in:</span>&nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\">&middot;&nbsp; </span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Effective implementation of aviation norms, rules, regulations, and industry best practices.</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of employment in the aviation sector, including pilot training, cabin crew training, and other aviation-related skill development initiatives.</span></li>\r\n<li><span lang=\"EN-US\">Promotion of aviation-related activities including Flying Training Organisations (FTOs).</span>&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><span lang=\"EN-US\">iv.&nbsp; </span><span lang=\"EN-US\">Coordination with national level flying academies for training, capacity building, and expansion opportunities</span></p><br>', '2026-04-30 12:45:58', 94, 1, '2026-04-30 13:18:56', 1),
(129, 146, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Master&rsquo;s Degree (or equivalent) in Management/MBA from University/Institute </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Minimum of 10+ years of total work experience related to project management/project coordination. </span></p> to <p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Master’s Degree (or equivalent) in Management/MBA from University/Institute </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">Minimum of 10+ years of total work experience related to project management/project coordination. </span></p>.<br>Remark changed from <p>Team Leader :-&nbsp;</p>\r\n<table class=\"MsoTableGrid\" style=\"margin-left: 30.35pt; border-collapse: collapse; border-image: initial; height: 448px; width: 2520px; border: medium none currentcolor;\" border=\"1\" width=\"1574\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<tbody>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 14.95pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 2503.62px; border: 1pt solid windowtext; padding: 0in 5.4pt; height: 14.95pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"255\">\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Responsible for overall functioning of the Programme Management Unit (PMU). </span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0