(143, 146, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Master&rsquo;s in agriculture/ /Agribusiness Management from a recognize University, 3+ years of experience in agri domain and working with FPOs/Large Farmers&rsquo; Groups</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">.</span></p> to <p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Master’s in agriculture/ /Agribusiness Management from a recognize University, 3+ years of experience in agri domain and working with FPOs/Large Farmers’ Groups</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">.</span></p>.<br>Remark changed from <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Agriculture and Allied Specialist <br></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Assess training needs and design programs on sustainable agriculture through FPOs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Provide on-field technical support to farmers on Agricultural Practices and climate-resilient farming.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Partner with agencies and technical institutions to deliver specialized trainings.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Guide FPOs in developing input businesses and promoting sustainable inputs.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Improve nutrition among rural women and households through the promotion and establishment of nutrition gardens to enhance household food security, dietary diversity, and sustainable access to nutrient-rich foods</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Advise on harvest and post-harvest practices and quality improvement for value addition.</spa