(144, 146, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Remark changed from <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Coordinator Livelihood &amp; Skill Development&nbsp;<em><br></em></span></strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Carry out diagnostic study to understand the socio-economic conditions in mining affected villages and analyze the impact (or deficit) of existing government schemes/ projects in purview of livelihood opportunities and health care sector.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Identification of alternate livelihood opportunities for mining affected people.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Formation of strengthening of Producer Groups and Farmer Producer Organizations including institution building and capacity building of groups members and other stakeholders.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Conduct participatory planning and need assessment exercise in the mining affected villages in the district.&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Support in Converge with various lines to improve effectiveness of interventions on livelihood and health care projects.</span></p> to <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Coordinator Livelihood &amp; Skill Development&nbsp;<em><br></em></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63eu3o\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"245\">Carry out diagnostic studies to understand the socio-economic conditions in mining-affected villages and analyze the impact (or gaps) of existing government schemes/projects in the areas of livelihood opportunities and the healthcare sector.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nc7qcg\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"323\">Identify alternative livelihood opportunities for mining-affected people.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x94nn4\" data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"515\">Support the formation and strengthening of Producer Groups and Farmer Producer Organizations, including institution building and capacity building of group members and other stakeholders.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjkm0t\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"625\">Conduct participatory planning and need assessment exercises in mining-affected villages in the district.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gtq00z\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Support convergence with various line departments to improve the effectiveness of interventions in livelihood and healthcare projects.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 30-04-2026, 01:17 PM', '2026-04-30 13:17:06', 405, 1, '2026-04-30 13:19:30', 1),
