(155, 149, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Position changed from Consultant to Principal Consultant.<br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./B.Tech./ MBA (or equivalent)/ Relevant master\'s degree</li>\r\n<li>5+ years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Prior IT experience will be preferred</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li>B.E. / B. Tech./ relevant bachelor&rsquo;s degree/ relevant Master degree / MBA(or equivalent)</li>\r\n<li>7+ years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 2 years of experience in managing Information Technology and other IT related services projects</li>\r\n<li>Prior IT experience will be preferred&nbsp;</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 01-05-2026, 12:34 PM', '2026-05-01 12:34:16', 90, 1, '2026-05-01 12:42:48', 1),
