(166, 146, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Position changed from Consultant to Associate Consultant.<br>Remark changed from <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Coordinator Livelihood &amp; Skill Development&nbsp;<em><br></em></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63eu3o\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"245\">Carry out diagnostic studies to understand the socio-economic conditions in mining-affected villages and analyze the impact (or gaps) of existing government schemes/projects in the areas of livelihood opportunities and the healthcare sector.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nc7qcg\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"323\">Identify alternative livelihood opportunities for mining-affected people.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x94nn4\" data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"515\">Support the formation and strengthening of Producer Groups and Farmer Producer Organizations, including institution building and capacity building of group members and other stakeholders.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjkm0t\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"625\">Conduct participatory planning and need assessment exercises in mining-affected villages in the district.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gtq00z\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Support convergence with various line departments to improve the effectiveness of interventions in livelihood and healthcare projects.</li>\r\n</ul> to <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Coordinator Livelihood & Skill Development <em><br></em></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"63eu3o\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"245\">Carry out diagnostic studies to understand the socio-economic conditions in mining-affected villages and analyze the impact (or gaps) of existing government schemes/projects in the areas of livelihood opportunities and the healthcare sector.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"nc7qcg\" data-start=\"246\" data-end=\"323\">Identify alternative livelihood opportunities for mining-affected people.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1x94nn4\" data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"515\">Support the formation and strengthening of Producer Groups and Farmer Producer Organizations, including institution building and capacity building of group members and other stakeholders.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"bjkm0t\" data-start=\"516\" data-end=\"625\">Conduct participatory planning and need assessment exercises in mining-affected villages in the district.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"1gtq00z\" data-start=\"626\" data-end=\"762\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Support convergence with various line departments to improve the effectiveness of interventions in livelihood and healthcare projects.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 05-05-2026, 03:15 PM', '2026-05-05 15:15:46', 405, 1, '2026-05-05 15:17:34', 1),
(167, 146, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Position changed from Consultant to Associate Consultant.<br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&bull;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Postgraduate in Social Work/ Rural Management/Agriculture, or related field, with at least 3+ years&rsquo; experience in institution and capacity development, preferably with CBOs/FPOs, and knowledge of governance and operations.</span></p> to <p class=\"Default\" style=\"margin-left: 17.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -17.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 17.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: \'Arial\',sans-serif; mso-fareast-font-family: Arial; color: windowtext;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">•<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">      </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span lang=\"EN-US\">Postgraduate in Social Work/ Rural Management/Agriculture, or related field, with at least 3+ years’ experience in institution and capacity development, preferably with CBOs/FPOs, and knowledge of governance and operations.</span></p>.<br>Remark changed from <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Training, Capacity and Skill Building Expert&nbsp;<br></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10r9fxk\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"52\">Strengthening governance and management systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"guv8du\" data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"155\">Design and deliver training for BoDs, CEOs, and members on governance, leadership, and operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3r5k1q\" data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"218\">Assess training needs and develop capacity-building plans.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3tgb5\" data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"281\">Collaborate with partners for effective training delivery.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwbqfp\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"395\">Develop SOPs for building skills in administration, finance, and operations of Community-Based Organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mxakc\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"453\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Document capacity-building outcomes and best practices.</li>\r\n</ul> to <p><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 10.5pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Aptos\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Aptos; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: MR;\">Training, Capacity and Skill Building Expert <br></span></strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"10r9fxk\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"52\">Strengthening governance and management systems.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"guv8du\" data-start=\"53\" data-end=\"155\">Design and deliver training for BoDs, CEOs, and members on governance, leadership, and operations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"3r5k1q\" data-start=\"156\" data-end=\"218\">Assess training needs and develop capacity-building plans.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"w3tgb5\" data-start=\"219\" data-end=\"281\">Collaborate with partners for effective training delivery.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"iwbqfp\" data-start=\"282\" data-end=\"395\">Develop SOPs for building skills in administration, finance, and operations of Community-Based Organizations.</li>\r\n<li data-section-id=\"13mxakc\" data-start=\"396\" data-end=\"453\" data-is-last-node=\"\">Document capacity-building outcomes and best practices.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 05-05-2026, 03:16 PM', '2026-05-05 15:16:00', 405, 1, '2026-05-05 15:17:27', 1),
