ing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:9376f682-6e46-4c9c-b826-ca39c8dc1ee8-78\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-152\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"ee94dca9-eff6-4c1e-8a77-47db8efbef9c\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"78\" data-end=\"1184\">&bull; Support planning, implementation, and monitoring of health and nutrition-related interventions, with a focus on mining-affected communities.<br data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"223\">&bull; Support assessment of health and nutrition needs in DMF-affected areas, especially populations impacted by mining-related health risks.<br data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"363\">&bull; Assist in design and prioritization of health and nutrition interventions under DMF, aligned with PMKKKY guidelines.<br data-start=\"481\" data-end=\"484\">&bull; Support development and strengthening of primary and secondary health care facilities in affected areas, ensuring not only infrastructure creation but also adequate staffing (doctors, paramedical and support staff), equipment, and essential medical supplies.<br data-start=\"744\" data-end=\"747\">&bull; Ensure interventions supplement and converge with existing health infrastructure of Local Bodies, State Government, and Central Government.<br data-start=\"888\" data-end=\"891\">&bull; Facilitate technical collaboration with the National Institute of Miners&rsquo; Health for designing specialized health infrastructure to address mining-related illnesses and diseases, including support for mobile health care units in affected regions.<br data-start=\"1139\" data-end=\"1142\">&bull; Support planning and implementation of Group Insurance Schemes for health care for mining-affected persons, where applicable.</p>\r\n<section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:9376f682-6e46-4c9c-b826-ca39c8dc1ee8-79\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-154\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col gap-4 grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal outline-none keyboard-focused:focus-ring [.text-message+&amp;]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" tabindex=\"0\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"4b992e6a-880b-4ebc-adc5-e9ccbc9b3840\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-3\" data-turn-start-message=\"true\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full wrap-break-word dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"170\" data-end=\"358\">&bull; Design and support special programmes for women and children, focusing on maternal and child health, malnutrition, infectious diseases, and other priority health concerns under PMKKKY.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"360\" data-end=\"512\">&bull; Coordinate with the Health Department, ICDS, Women &amp; Child Development, and allied departments to ensure effective convergence and service delivery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"514\" data-end=\"676\">&bull; Provide technical inputs for programme design, operational guidelines, implementation frameworks, and monitoring mechanisms for health and nutrition outcomes.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"678\" data-end=\"814\">&bull; Review the progress of health, nutrition, and women &amp; child welfare projects, and recommend corrective measures for improved impact.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"816\" data-end=\"979\">&bull; Support capacity building of frontline workers, awareness campaigns, and community engagement initiatives to promote preventive health and nutrition practices.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"981\" data-end=\"1145\">&bull; Contribute to reporting, documentation, monitoring, evaluation, and knowledge management related to health, nutrition, and social welfare outcomes in DMF areas.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1277\">&bull; Ensure availability of adequate human resources, medical equipment, infrastructure, ambulances, and other essential amenities.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1361\">&bull; Manage health staff hiring, ensure a fair duty roster, and resolve grievances.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1446\">&bull; Ensure NQAS qualification of all healthcare facilities present in the district.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1539\">&bull; Implement interventions to reduce MMR, IMR, malaria, dengue, anaemia, and malnutrition</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section>.<br>Remark changed from <table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" style=\"margin-left: 5.4pt; background: #4F81BD; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-layout-alt: fixed; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid white 1.0pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0cm 5.4pt 0cm 5.4pt; mso-border-insideh: 1.0pt solid white; mso-border-insidev: 1.0pt solid white;\" border=\"1\" width=\"714\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\">\r\n<thead>\r\n<tr style=\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 13.85pt;\">\r\n<td style=\"width: 70.5pt; border: solid black 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid black .5pt; background: transparent; padding: 4.0pt 4.0pt 4.0pt 9.35pt; height: 13.85pt;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"94\">\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n</td>\r\n<td style=\"width: