(179, 162, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./ B.Tech/ M.E./ M.Tech (Civil/ Environmental/Chemical Engineering) OR M.Sc. (Environmental&nbsp;Science/ Chemistry/ Environmental Engineering) OR&nbsp;EquivalentDegree from a recognized University.</li>\r\n<li>MBA / PG Diploma in Project Management<br>desirable.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 10+ Years\' relevant experience in solid<br>and/or liquid waste management projects,<br>preferably in government / PSU / State level<br>assignments.</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./ B.Tech/ M.E./ M.Tech (Civil/ Environmental/Chemical Engineering) OR M.Sc. (Environmental Science/ Chemistry/ Environmental Engineering) OR EquivalentDegree from a recognized University.</li>\r\n<li>MBA / PG Diploma in Project Management<br>desirable.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 10+ Years\' relevant experience in solid<br>and/or liquid waste management projects,<br>preferably in government / PSU / State level<br>assignments.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from  to <p>Project Lead &ndash;&nbsp;Solid &amp; Liquid&nbsp;Waste&nbsp;Management</p>.<br>on 13-05-2026, 05:33 PM', '2026-05-13 17:33:39', 21, 1, '2026-05-13 17:36:35', 1),
(180, 162, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./ B.Tech (Civil/ Environmental/ Chemical) AND&nbsp;M.E./ M.Tech (Environmental/ Civil/ Chemical&nbsp;Engineering) OR M.Sc. (Environmental Science /&nbsp;Chemistry) OR EquivalentDegree from a recognized&nbsp;University.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 7+ Years\' relevant experience in solid&nbsp;and/or liquid waste management projects,&nbsp;preferably in government / PSU / State level&nbsp;assignments.</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul>\r\n<li>B.E./ B.Tech (Civil/ Environmental/ Chemical) AND M.E./ M.Tech (Environmental/ Civil/ Chemical Engineering) OR M.Sc. (Environmental Science / Chemistry) OR EquivalentDegree from a recognized University.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 7+ Years\' relevant experience in solid and/or liquid waste management projects, preferably in government / PSU / State level assignments.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from  to <p>Subject Matter&nbsp;Expert</p>.<br>on 13-05-2026, 05:34 PM', '2026-05-13 17:34:11', 21, 1, '2026-05-13 17:36:29', 1),
