(216, 171, 'Project objective changed from <p dir=\"ltr\">The key objectives of the assignment are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, and governance mechanisms under DMFT Bijapur.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective utilization of DMF resources in accordance with PMKKKY Guidelines, State DMF Rules, and Government directives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and managerial assistance for project formulation, appraisal, implementation, monitoring, and evaluation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen institutional capacity of DMFT through innovation, best practices, knowledge management, stakeholder engagement, and data-driven decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence of DMF projects with Government schemes, CSR initiatives, and other developmental programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Improve transparency, accountability, and outcome-oriented implementation of DMF-supported interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen evidence-based planning and monitoring through digital tools, dashboards, MIS systems, and AI-enabled analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h1 dir=\"ltr\">1. Introduction</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The District Mineral Foundation (DMF), Bijapur, is a statutory trust established for the welfare of communities and regions affected by mining activities in the district. Bijapur is characterized by a predominantly tribal population, difficult geographical terrain, dispersed habitations, and Left Wing Extremism (LWE)-affected areas that require focused development interventions and effective service delivery mechanisms.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">DMFT Bijapur undertakes developmental interventions across sectors such as health, nutrition, education, skill development, livelihoods, drinking water, sanitation, women and child development, tribal development, infrastructure, and other priority areas identified by the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">To strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, evaluation, governance, and effective utilization of DMF resources, DMFT Bijapur intends to establish a Project Management Unit (PMU) through a Tier-II empanelled consultancy firm. The PMU shall provide technical, managerial, analytical, monitoring, and field-level support to DMFT Bijapur and the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The PMU shall function as a strategic support unit for project identification, project design, appraisal, implementation support, monitoring, evaluation, infrastructure verification, digital governance, knowledge management, and institutional strengthening.</p>\r\n<h1 dir=\"ltr\">2. Objectives</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The key objectives of the assignment are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, and governance mechanisms under DMFT Bijapur.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective utilization of DMF resources in accordance with PMKKKY Guidelines, State DMF Rules, and Government directives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and managerial assistance for project formulation, appraisal, implementation, monitoring, and evaluation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen institutional capacity of DMFT through innovation, best practices, knowledge management, stakeholder engagement, and data-driven decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence of DMF projects with Government schemes, CSR initiatives, and other developmental programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Improve transparency, accountability, and outcome-oriented implementation of DMF-supported interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen evidence-based planning and monitoring through digital tools, dashboards, MIS systems, and AI-enabled analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p><br>', '2026-06-11 17:41:24', 623, 1, '2026-06-12 15:02:30', 1),
(217, 171, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">B.E./B.Tech in Civil Engineering.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">M.E./M.Tech/ Master\'s Degree in Business Administration / Infrastructure Management / Construction Management / Project Management / Public Policy / Rural Development or equivalent.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">B.E./B.Tech in Civil Engineering.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">M.E./M.Tech/ Master\'s Degree in Business Administration / Infrastructure Management / Construction Management / Project Management / Public Policy / Rural Development or equivalent.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">Minimum 3+ years experience as mentioned in the letter .</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>.<br>Remark changed from <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Remarks</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong ability to assess technical aspects of infrastructure projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in physical verification and quality assessment of public infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to review and appraise DPRs and technical proposals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Knowledge of project feasibility assessment, cost estimation, benchmarking, and infrastructure planning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Exposure to geotagging, GIS-based asset mapping, and infrastructure monitoring systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to support projects across sectors, including health, education, livelihood, water supply, sanitation, tribal development, skill development, and public infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to work in remote and tribal areas and undertake extensive field visits.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Remarks</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strong ability to assess technical aspects of infrastructure projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in physical verification and quality assessment of public infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to review and appraise DPRs and technical proposals.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Knowledge of project feasibility assessment, cost estimation, benchmarking, and infrastructure planning.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Exposure to geotagging, GIS-based asset mapping, and infrastructure monitoring systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to support projects across sectors, including health, education, livelihood, water supply, sanitation, tribal development, skill development, and public infrastructure.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to work in remote and tribal areas and undertake extensive field visits.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>.<br>on 11-06-2026, 05:42 PM', '2026-06-11 17:42:31', 623, 1, '2026-06-12 15:02:37', 1),
(218, 171, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Any relevant Bachelor&rsquo;s degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Master of Social Work (MSW)/Master\'s Degree in Business Administration / Project Management / Public Policy / Rural Development/ Public Health/ Education or equivalent</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Qualification</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Any relevant Bachelor&rsquo;s degree.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Master of Social Work (MSW)/Master\'s Degree in Business Administration / Project Management / Public Policy / Rural Development/ Public Health/ Education or equivalent.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 3+ years experience as mentioned in the letter.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>.<br>Remark changed from <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Remarks</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Demonstrated experience in social development programmes, community mobilization, stakeholder engagement, participatory planning, and implementation of development interventions in rural, tribal, and vulnerable communities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in working with Government departments, local governance institutions, civil society organizations, community-based organizations, Self Help Groups (SHGs), and grassroots stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to support projects across health, education, livelihood promotion, tribal development, women and child development, governance, infrastructure, and other development sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in conducting field assessments, beneficiary consultations, need assessments, social audits, impact assessments, and monitoring &amp; evaluation studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to facilitate community consultations, focus group discussions, participatory rural appraisal exercises, and stakeholder workshops.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in project planning, implementation support, documentation, reporting, and outcome tracking for social sector initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Proficiency in digital survey design, mobile data collection platforms, and data digitization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to develop dashboards, MIS systems, analytical reports, and data visualization tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Working knowledge of AI-enabled tools for analytics, reporting, knowledge management, and decision-support systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to undertake extensive field visits, beneficiary interactions, stakeholder consultations, and community engagement activities in remote and tribal areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h3 dir=\"ltr\">Remarks</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Demonstrated experience in social development programmes, community mobilization, stakeholder engagement, participatory planning, and implementation of development interventions in rural, tribal, and vulnerable communities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in working with Government departments, local governance institutions, civil society organizations, community-based organizations, Self Help Groups (SHGs), and grassroots stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to support projects across health, education, livelihood promotion, tribal development, women and child development, governance, infrastructure, and other development sectors.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in conducting field assessments, beneficiary consultations, need assessments, social audits, impact assessments, and monitoring & evaluation studies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to facilitate community consultations, focus group discussions, participatory rural appraisal exercises, and stakeholder workshops.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Experience in project planning, implementation support, documentation, reporting, and outcome tracking for social sector initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Proficiency in digital survey design, mobile data collection platforms, and data digitization.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to develop dashboards, MIS systems, analytical reports, and data visualization tools.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Working knowledge of AI-enabled tools for analytics, reporting, knowledge management, and decision-support systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Ability to undertake extensive field visits, beneficiary interactions, stakeholder consultations, and community engagement activities in remote and tribal areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p> </p>.<br>on 11-06-2026, 05:43 PM', '2026-06-11 17:43:02', 623, 1, '2026-06-12 15:02:08', 1),
(219, 170, 'Scope of work changed from <p>The scope of work for the Programme Management Unit (PMU) is outlined below &ndash;</p>\r\n<p>1) Market-Linked Agri-Business Development for FPOs:</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Facilitate market linkages for cluster-linked FPOs through:</p>\r\n<p>o Buyer meetings and linkages, and exposure visits</p>\r\n<p>o Facilitate support for market linkage MoUs / alliances</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Facilitate value chain advisory support with a focus on leveraging convergence across government departments, relevant schemes, and institutions.</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Facilitate enhancement of product quality and marketability of prioritized crops</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Conduct a rapid assessment of the status of FPOs across the state</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Develop a comprehensive framework for strengthening FPOs, incorporating modules on governance and compliance, capacity building, business planning, digital enablement, and modules alignment with government schemes.</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Develop monitoring frameworks for assessing the progress of FPOs in the State</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>2) Scheme Monitoring and optimization</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Develop a robust Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) framework incorporating benchmarking indicators, aligned with key outcome indicators to measure the effectiveness of interventions.</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Develop a repository of scheme data, performance visualization presentations, and facilitate systematic review and implementation red-flagging to aid in achievement of physical / financial achievements against schemes</p>\r\n<p>Conduct data analysis to identify implementation challenges, conduct stakeholder connect, take up field truthing visits and suggest plans for improving implementation efficiency</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Documentations of success stories etc adopted by farmers in the state to enable cross-learning.</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>3) Process Governance</p>\r\n<p>&middot; Monitor and facilitate progress of activities including SOP specialized input- output related activities to ensure timely completion and alignment with process guidelines.</p>\r\n<p>o Maintain structured records of approvals and process steps to support governance and review readiness.</p>\r\n<p>o Assist in coordinating and guiding external entities through approved digital systems, ensuring adherence to established protocols.</p>\r\n<p>o Identify delays or gaps in workflows and recommend improvements for efficiency and transparency.</p>\r\n<p>o Conduct training sessions for stakeholders on effective adherence to workflows and governance standards.</p>\r\n<p>o Develop periodic reports on workflow progress, turnaround timelines, and compliance indicators for senior management reviews</p> to <p>The scope of work for the Programme Management Unit (PMU) is outlined below &ndash;</p>\r\n<p><strong>1) Market-Linked Agri-Business Development for FPOs:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Facilitate market linkages for cluster-linked FPOs through:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Buyer meetings and linkages, and exposure visits</li>\r\n<li>Facilitate support for market linkage MoUs / alliances</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li>Facilitate value chain advisory support with a focus on leveraging convergence across government departments, relevant schemes, and institutions.</li>\r\n<li>Facilitate enhancement of product quality and marketability of prioritized crops</li>\r\n<li>Conduct a rapid assessment of the status of FPOs across the state</li>\r\n<li>Develop a comprehensive framework for strengthening FPOs, incorporating modules on governance and compliance, capacity building, business planning, digital enablement, and modules alignment with government schemes.</li>\r\n<li>Develop monitoring frameworks for assessing the progress of FPOs in the State</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>2) Scheme Monitoring and optimization</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Develop a robust Monitoring and Evaluation (M&amp;E) framework incorporating benchmarking indicators, aligned with key outcome indicators to measure the effectiveness of interventions.</li>\r\n<li>Develop a repository of scheme data, performance visualization presentations, and facilitate systematic review and implementation red-flagging to aid in achievement of physical / financial achievements against schemes</li>\r\n<li>Conduct data analysis to identify implementation challenges, conduct stakeholder connect, take up field truthing visits and suggest plans for improving implementation efficiency</li>\r\n<li>Documentations of success stories etc adopted by farmers in the state to enable cross-learning.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>3) Process Governance</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Monitor and facilitate progress of activities including SOP specialized input- output related activities to ensure timely completion and alignment with process guidelines.\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Maintain structured records of approvals and process steps to support governance and review readiness.</li>\r\n<li>Assist in coordinating and guiding external entities through approved digital systems, ensuring adherence to established protocols.</li>\r\n<li>Identify delays or gaps in workflows and recommend improvements for efficiency and transparency.</li>\r\n<li>Conduct training sessions for stakeholders on effective adherence to workflows and governance standards.</li>\r\n<li>Develop periodic reports on workflow progress, turnaround timelines, and compliance indicators for senior management reviews</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><br>Special condition of contract changed from <p><strong>Duration of the assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p>The consultancy team shall be engaged for an initial period of thirty-six (36) months, with the option for extension based on mutual agreement. The consultants will be onboarded through the CHiPS empanelment process.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for technical and operational support be released on person month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment.</li>\r\n<li>The payment will be as per current resources person month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement</li>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n</ul> to <p><strong>Duration of the assignment</strong></p>\r\n<p>The consultancy team shall be engaged for an initial period of thirty-six (36) months, with the option for extension based on mutual agreement. The consultants will be onboarded through the CHiPS empanelment process.</p>\r\n<p><strong>Payment Terms</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Payment to selected bidder for technical and operational support be released on person month basis, post submission of the invoice for payment.</li>\r\n<li>The payment will be as per current resources person month rates applicable under empanelment and payment terms will be governed terms and conditions of Empanelment agreement</li>\r\n<li>Penalty, if any, shall be governed as per the agreed empanelment terms.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>Deliverables:</strong></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Convergence roadmap</li>\r\n<li>Market Linkage Plan Document</li>\r\n<li>Branding &amp; Certification Toolkit for FPO products</li>\r\n<li>Market interactions, and connect for facilitating partnerships of buyers sellers</li>\r\n<li>FPO Baseline Assessment Report covering operational status and gaps.</li>\r\n<li>Training Modules for FPO Strengthening</li>\r\n<li>Governance Framework and training modules</li>\r\n<li>Half-yearly and Annual Performance Reports summarizing scheme achievements and gaps.</li>\r\n<li>Scheme performance delta reports</li>\r\n<li>Repository of scheme data</li>\r\n<li>Monitoring and evaluation of key Central Sponsored Schemes and State Sponsored Schemes across the state.</li>\r\n<li>Compendium of Success Stories &amp; Best Practices for cross-learning dissemination.<strong><br></strong></li>\r\n</ul><br>', '2026-06-14 10:31:02', 24, 1, '2026-06-14 10:35:52', 1);
INSERT INTO `log_eoi_updates` (`recordid`, `requestid`, `particular`, `updatedon`, `updatedby`, `isviewed`, `viewedon`, `viewedby`) VALUES
(220, 171, 'Project objective changed from <h1 dir=\"ltr\">1. Introduction</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The District Mineral Foundation (DMF), Bijapur, is a statutory trust established for the welfare of communities and regions affected by mining activities in the district. Bijapur is characterized by a predominantly tribal population, difficult geographical terrain, dispersed habitations, and Left Wing Extremism (LWE)-affected areas that require focused development interventions and effective service delivery mechanisms.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">DMFT Bijapur undertakes developmental interventions across sectors such as health, nutrition, education, skill development, livelihoods, drinking water, sanitation, women and child development, tribal development, infrastructure, and other priority areas identified by the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">To strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, evaluation, governance, and effective utilization of DMF resources, DMFT Bijapur intends to establish a Project Management Unit (PMU) through a Tier-II empanelled consultancy firm. The PMU shall provide technical, managerial, analytical, monitoring, and field-level support to DMFT Bijapur and the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The PMU shall function as a strategic support unit for project identification, project design, appraisal, implementation support, monitoring, evaluation, infrastructure verification, digital governance, knowledge management, and institutional strengthening.</p>\r\n<h1 dir=\"ltr\">2. Objectives</h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The key objectives of the assignment are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, and governance mechanisms under DMFT Bijapur.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective utilization of DMF resources in accordance with PMKKKY Guidelines, State DMF Rules, and Government directives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and managerial assistance for project formulation, appraisal, implementation, monitoring, and evaluation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen institutional capacity of DMFT through innovation, best practices, knowledge management, stakeholder engagement, and data-driven decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence of DMF projects with Government schemes, CSR initiatives, and other developmental programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Improve transparency, accountability, and outcome-oriented implementation of DMF-supported interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen evidence-based planning and monitoring through digital tools, dashboards, MIS systems, and AI-enabled analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <h1 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">1. Introduction</span></h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The District Mineral Foundation (DMF), Bijapur, is a statutory trust established for the welfare of communities and regions affected by mining activities in the district. Bijapur is characterized by a predominantly tribal population, difficult geographical terrain, dispersed habitations, and Left Wing Extremism (LWE)-affected areas that require focused development interventions and effective service delivery mechanisms.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">DMFT Bijapur undertakes developmental interventions across sectors such as health, nutrition, education, skill development, livelihoods, drinking water, sanitation, women and child development, tribal development, infrastructure, and other priority areas identified by the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">To strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, evaluation, governance, and effective utilization of DMF resources, DMFT Bijapur intends to establish a Project Management Unit (PMU) through a Tier-II empanelled consultancy firm. The PMU shall provide technical, managerial, analytical, monitoring, and field-level support to DMFT Bijapur and the District Administration.</p>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The PMU shall function as a strategic support unit for project identification, project design, appraisal, implementation support, monitoring, evaluation, infrastructure verification, digital governance, knowledge management, and institutional strengthening.</p>\r\n<h1 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">2. Objectives</span></h1>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The key objectives of the assignment are:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen planning, implementation, monitoring, and governance mechanisms under DMFT Bijapur.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective utilization of DMF resources in accordance with PMKKKY Guidelines, State DMF Rules, and Government directives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and managerial assistance for project formulation, appraisal, implementation, monitoring, and evaluation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen institutional capacity of DMFT through innovation, best practices, knowledge management, stakeholder engagement, and data-driven decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence of DMF projects with Government schemes, CSR initiatives, and other developmental programs.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Improve transparency, accountability, and outcome-oriented implementation of DMF-supported interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Strengthen evidence-based planning and monitoring through digital tools, dashboards, MIS systems, and AI-enabled analytics.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><br>Scope of work changed from <p dir=\"ltr\">The selected agency shall function as a \"DMF Resource and Project Management Support Unit\" and shall be responsible for the following activities:</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">A. Programme Management and Governance Support</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide managerial and technical support to DMFT Bijapur in accordance with State DMF Rules, PMKKKY Guidelines, and applicable Government instructions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective allocation and utilization of DMF resources.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist DMFT in project planning, implementation, monitoring, review, and reporting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and facilitation support to the DMF Trust Board, Governing Council, Managing Committee, and Executive Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of agenda notes, presentations, policy briefs, concept notes, and review documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate coordination between district administration, line departments, implementing agencies, community institutions, and other stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">B. Project Identification, Design and Appraisal</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify development gaps and priority interventions in mining-affected areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of concept notes, project proposals, Detailed Project Reports (DPRs), implementation frameworks, and operational plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review and technically appraise DPRs and project proposals submitted by departments and agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assess feasibility, sustainability, scalability, and expected outcomes of proposed interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support project prioritization based on impact, need, feasibility, and alignment with district priorities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop project-specific monitoring frameworks and implementation roadmaps.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">C. Infrastructure Planning, Verification and Technical Assessment</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct technical assessment of infrastructure projects supported through DMF.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake physical verification of assets and infrastructure projects through field inspections.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assess quality, functionality, utilization, and maintenance requirements of infrastructure created under DMF.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Verify project progress through field visits, geotagged documentation, photographs, beneficiary interactions, and physical observations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support quality assurance and quality control measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify implementation bottlenecks and recommend corrective actions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in preparation, review, and validation of technical reports and progress assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">D. Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL)</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop monitoring and evaluation frameworks for DMF projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Define key performance indicators (KPIs), outputs, outcomes, and impact indicators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct periodic monitoring of projects and schemes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake impact assessment studies, beneficiary assessments, and outcome evaluations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct social audits and independent verification exercises whenever required.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop feedback mechanisms for beneficiaries and stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Document lessons learned, innovations, success stories, and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of annual performance assessments and outcome reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">E. Digital Governance, MIS and Data Management</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Design and manage digital survey tools and data collection systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop and maintain project databases, dashboards, and management information systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate digitization of project records, reports, and documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop geotagged asset inventories and project tracking systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support data analytics, visualization, and evidence-based decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Promote adoption of AI-enabled tools for analytics, reporting, monitoring, and knowledge management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Generate periodic MIS reports for review by DMFT and District Administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">F. Sectoral Support</h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The PMU shall provide technical, managerial, analytical, and field-level support across all sectors permissible under DMF and PMKKKY guidelines including but not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Health and Nutrition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Skill Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Livelihood Promotion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Tribal Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Women and Child Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Agriculture and Allied Sectors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Drinking Water Supply</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Sanitation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Rural and Urban Infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Renewable Energy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Digital Governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Environmental Sustainability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Sports and Youth Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Culture and Heritage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Any other sector identified by the District Administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">G. Convergence and Resource Optimization</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify opportunities for convergence with Central and State Government schemes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence with CSR initiatives, development partners, and external agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support integration of departmental programs for maximizing developmental outcomes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop frameworks for coordinated implementation across departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">H. Procurement, Financial and Compliance Support</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support procurement-related activities associated with DMF projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in maintaining compliance with DMF Rules, PMKKKY Guidelines, and statutory requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support documentation for audits, inspections, and reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in strengthening internal controls, financial discipline, and reporting systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">I. Knowledge Management and Capacity Building</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Organize workshops, trainings, consultations, and stakeholder engagements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop knowledge products, manuals, SOPs, and guidance documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate dissemination of best practices and cross-learning initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Build capacities of implementing agencies and stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\">J. Other Responsibilities</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake any strategic, technical, analytical, monitoring, evaluation, documentation, coordination, capacity building, field verification, project management, or governance support activity assigned by the District Collector, Governing Council, Managing Committee, Chief Executive Officer, or any authorized officer of DMFT Bijapur from time to time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p>&nbsp;</p> to <p dir=\"ltr\">The selected agency shall function as a \"DMF Resource and Project Management Support Unit\" and shall be responsible for the following activities:</p>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">A. Programme Management and Governance Support</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide managerial and technical support to DMFT Bijapur in accordance with State DMF Rules, PMKKKY Guidelines, and applicable Government instructions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support effective allocation and utilization of DMF resources.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist DMFT in project planning, implementation, monitoring, review, and reporting.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Provide technical and facilitation support to the DMF Trust Board, Governing Council, Managing Committee, and Executive Committee.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of agenda notes, presentations, policy briefs, concept notes, and review documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate coordination between district administration, line departments, implementing agencies, community institutions, and other stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">B. Project Identification, Design and Appraisal</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify development gaps and priority interventions in mining-affected areas.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of concept notes, project proposals, Detailed Project Reports (DPRs), implementation frameworks, and operational plans.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Review and technically appraise DPRs and project proposals submitted by departments and agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assess feasibility, sustainability, scalability, and expected outcomes of proposed interventions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support project prioritization based on impact, need, feasibility, and alignment with district priorities.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop project-specific monitoring frameworks and implementation roadmaps.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">C. Infrastructure Planning, Verification and Technical Assessment</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct technical assessment of infrastructure projects supported through DMF.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake physical verification of assets and infrastructure projects through field inspections.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assess quality, functionality, utilization, and maintenance requirements of infrastructure created under DMF.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Verify project progress through field visits, geotagged documentation, photographs, beneficiary interactions, and physical observations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support quality assurance and quality control measures.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify implementation bottlenecks and recommend corrective actions.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in preparation, review, and validation of technical reports and progress assessments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">D. Monitoring, Evaluation and Learning (MEL)</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop monitoring and evaluation frameworks for DMF projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Define key performance indicators (KPIs), outputs, outcomes, and impact indicators.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct periodic monitoring of projects and schemes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake impact assessment studies, beneficiary assessments, and outcome evaluations.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Conduct social audits and independent verification exercises whenever required.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop feedback mechanisms for beneficiaries and stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Document lessons learned, innovations, success stories, and best practices.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support preparation of annual performance assessments and outcome reports.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">E. Digital Governance, MIS and Data Management</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Design and manage digital survey tools and data collection systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop and maintain project databases, dashboards, and management information systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate digitization of project records, reports, and documentation.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop geotagged asset inventories and project tracking systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support data analytics, visualization, and evidence-based decision making.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Promote adoption of AI-enabled tools for analytics, reporting, monitoring, and knowledge management.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Generate periodic MIS reports for review by DMFT and District Administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">F. Sectoral Support</span></h2>\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\">The PMU shall provide technical, managerial, analytical, and field-level support across all sectors permissible under DMF and PMKKKY guidelines including but not limited to:</p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Health and Nutrition</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Education</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Skill Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Livelihood Promotion</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Tribal Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Women and Child Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Agriculture and Allied Sectors</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Drinking Water Supply</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Sanitation</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Rural and Urban Infrastructure</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Renewable Energy</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Digital Governance</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Environmental Sustainability</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Sports and Youth Development</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Culture and Heritage</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Any other sector identified by the District Administration.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">G. Convergence and Resource Optimization</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Identify opportunities for convergence with Central and State Government schemes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate convergence with CSR initiatives, development partners, and external agencies.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support integration of departmental programs for maximizing developmental outcomes.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop frameworks for coordinated implementation across departments.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">H. Procurement, Financial and Compliance Support</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support procurement-related activities associated with DMF projects.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in maintaining compliance with DMF Rules, PMKKKY Guidelines, and statutory requirements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Support documentation for audits, inspections, and reviews.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Assist in strengthening internal controls, financial discipline, and reporting systems.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">I. Knowledge Management and Capacity Building</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Organize workshops, trainings, consultations, and stakeholder engagements.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Develop knowledge products, manuals, SOPs, and guidance documents.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Facilitate dissemination of best practices and cross-learning initiatives.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Build capacities of implementing agencies and stakeholders.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">J. Other Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Undertake any strategic, technical, analytical, monitoring, evaluation, documentation, coordination, capacity building, field verification, project management, or governance support activity assigned by the District Collector, Governing Council, Managing Committee, Chief Executive Officer, or any authorized officer of DMFT Bijapur from time to time.</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul><br>', '2026-06-14 10:53:08', 623, 1, '2026-06-14 