(257, 176, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Sector changed from FINANCIAL AND LEGAL to ENGINEERING.<br>Qualification changed from <ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">B. Tech /B. E /Relevant bachelor&rsquo;s degree/ MBA (or equivalent)/ Relevant master&rsquo;s degree</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">5+ years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Experience in PPP transaction advisory across EPC, Hybrid Annuity Model (HAM), and Toll-Operate-Transfer (TOT) project structures, including bid process management, drafting of RFPs and contract management for road/highway infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Exposure to NHAI, State PWD, or Road Development Corporation transactions preferred.</li>\r\n</ul> to <ul class=\"ul1\">\r\n<li class=\"li1\">B. Tech /B. E /Relevant bachelor’s degree/ MBA (or equivalent)/ Relevant master’s degree</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">5+ years of relevant experience</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Experience in PPP transaction advisory across EPC, Hybrid Annuity Model (HAM), and Toll-Operate-Transfer (TOT) project structures, including bid process management, drafting of RFPs and contract management for road/highway infrastructure projects.</li>\r\n<li class=\"li1\">Exposure to NHAI, State PWD, or Road Development Corporation transactions preferred.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 15-07-2026, 05:19 PM', '2026-07-15 17:19:17', 719, 1, '2026-07-15 17:19:45', 1);
