 Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Familiarity with HTML/CSS is a plus (for effective developer communication).</p> to <p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bachelor\'s or Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>or<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Bacorhelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Design, Human-Computer Interaction (HCI), Computer Science, or a related field.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->5 years of experience in UX/UI design or a similar role.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: none; margin: 3.45pt 5.85pt .0001pt 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>will<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>be<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>given<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>experienced<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>candidates<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>work in Govt.<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>Organization.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">Proficiency in design and prototyping tools such as Figma, Adobe Creative Cloud, Sketch, or equivalent tools.</span></span></span></span><!--[endif]--></p>.<br>Remark changed from <h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>User Research</strong>: Conduct user research, interviews, surveys, and usability tests to understand user needs and behaviours.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Wire framing &amp; Prototyping</strong>: Create wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes using tools like Figma, Adobe XD, or Sketch.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>User Journey Mapping</strong>: Develop user personas, journey maps, and user flows to guide design decisions.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Collaboration</strong>: Work closely with UI designers, developers, and project teams to ensure seamless user experience integration.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Feedback &amp; Testing</strong>: Incorporate feedback from stakeholders and users to refine designs; conduct A/B testing where applicable.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Design Documentation</strong>: Prepare design specifications and documentation to support development teams.<br><br></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Basic understanding of UX/UI design and visual design principles.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience working on government, enterprise, or public-facing applications.</p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong communication and presentation skills in <strong>English and Hindi</strong>.</p> to <h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></strong></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>User Research</strong>: Conduct user research, interviews, surveys, and usability tests to understand user needs and behaviours.</p>\r\n<p style=\"mar