lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Working knowledge of MS Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), project documentation, and office management practices.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ability to independently handle official correspondence, prepare reports, maintain project records, and coordinate with multiple stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Basic understanding of e-Governance projects, website management will be preferred.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference will be given to candidates having experience of working in Government Organizations or Government IT/e-Governance projects.</p> to <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree in Engineering (B.E./B.Tech.) in any discipline, MBA, Management, or any other equivalent professional qualification from a recognized University/Institution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minimum <strong>4 years</strong> of professional experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience in project coordination, Government correspondence, file processing, documentation, report preparation, and stakeholder management.</p>.<br>Remark changed from <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement of the State Portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>File Management:</strong> Process and maintain project files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and related documentation in accordance with Government procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain DPRs, TORs, proposals, meeting minutes, technical notes, project reports, presentations, utilization reports, and other project-related documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Administrative Support:</strong> Assist in processing administrative and financial proposals, manpower deployment, contract-related documents, and other official matters pertaining to the project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Monitoring & Reporting:</strong> Monitor project progress, timelines, milestones, resource deployment, and deliverables, and prepare periodic progress reports for higher authorities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Compliance:</strong> Ensure project documentation and activities comply with Government rules, departmental guidelines, contractual obligations, and applicable standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Meeting Coordination:</strong> Organize meetings, prepare agendas, record minutes of meetings (MoMs), and follow up on action points with concerned stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Support to Management:</strong> Provide administrative and coordination support to senior officers in project planning, review meetings, and decision-making processes.<br><br></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in handling Government files, official noting and drafting, DPR preparation, and procurement-related documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Knowledge of Government administrative procedures, project monitoring.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Familiarity with project management and documentation tools.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Understanding of e-Governance initiatives and digital service delivery frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Strong communication, drafting, presentation, and interpersonal skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul> to <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement of the State Portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>File Management:</strong> Process and maintain project files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and related documentation in accordance with Government procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-le