-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree in Engineering (B.E./B.Tech.) in any discipline, MBA, Management, or any other equivalent professional qualification from a recognized University/Institution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minimum <strong>4 years</strong> of professional experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience in project coordination, Government correspondence, file processing, documentation, report preparation, and stakeholder management.</p>.<br>Remark changed from <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement of the State Portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>File Management:</strong> Process and maintain project files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and related documentation in accordance with Government procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain DPRs, TORs, proposals, meeting minutes, technical notes, project reports, presentations, utilization reports, and other project-related documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Administrative Support:</strong> Assist in processing administrative and financial proposals, manpower deployment, contract-related documents, and other official matters pertaining to the project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong> Monitor project progress, timelines, milestones, resource deployment, and deliverables, and prepare periodic progress reports for higher authorities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Compliance:</strong> Ensure project documentation and activities comply with Government rules, departmental guidelines, contractual obligations, and applicable standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Meeting Coordination:</strong> Organize meetings, prepare agendas, record minutes of meetings (MoMs), and follow up on action points with concerned stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Support to Management:</strong> Provide administrative and coordination support to senior officers in project planning, review meetings, and decision-making processes.<br><br></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in handling Government files, official noting and drafting, DPR preparation, and procurement-related documentation,&nbsp;project documentation, and office management practices.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Knowledge of Government administrative procedures, project monitoring.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Familiarity with project management and documentation tools.<span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Working knowledge of MS Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint)</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Understanding of e-Governance initiatives and digital service delivery frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Strong communication, drafting, presentation, and interpersonal skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference will be given to candidates having experience of working in Government Organizations or Government IT/e-Governance projects.</li>\r\n</ul> to <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement of the State Portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>File Management:</strong> Process and maintain project files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and related documentation in accordance with Government procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain DPRs, TORs, proposals, meeting minutes, technical notes, project reports, presentations, utilization reports, and other project-related documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Administrative Support:</strong> Assist in processing administrative and financial proposals, manpower deployment, contract-related documents, and other official matters pertaining to the project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong> Monitor project progress, timelines, milestones, resource deployment, and deliverables, and prepare periodic progress reports for higher authorities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Compliance:</strong> Ensure project documentation and activities comply with Government rules, departmental guidelines, contractual obligations, and applicable standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Meeting Coordination:</strong> Organize meetings, prepare agendas, record minutes of meetings (MoMs), and follow up on action points with concerned stakeholders.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Support to Management:</strong> Provide administrative and coordination support to senior officers in project planning, review meetings, and decision-making processes.<br><br></p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in handling Government files, official noting and drafting, DPR preparation, and procurement-related documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Knowledge of Government administrative procedures, project monitoring.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Familiarity with project management and documentation tools.<span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; </span></span></span></li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><!--[endif]-->Working knowledge of MS Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), project documentation, and office management practices</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Understanding of e-Governance initiatives and digital service delivery frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Strong communication, drafting, presentation, and interpersonal skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference will be given to candidates having experience of working in Government Organizations or Government IT/e-Governance projects.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 03-09-2026, 04:30 PM', '2026-09-03 16:30:56', 60, 1, '2026-09-03 16:39:00', 1),
(265, 182, 'The project manager has uploaded new files. Kindly review the details.', '2026-09-03 16:32:05', 60, 1, '2026-09-03 16:38:55', 1);
INSERT INTO `log_eoi_updates` (`recordid`, `requestid`, `particular`, `updatedon`, `updatedby`, `isviewed`, `viewedon`, `viewedby`) VALUES
(266, 182, 'Scope of work changed from <h1 style=\"margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933835\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt;\">3.1 Database Admin &ndash;Level 7</span></strong></h1>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The <strong>Database Administrator (DBA)</strong> will be responsible for the installation, configuration, administration, monitoring, performance optimization, backup, recovery, security, and maintenance of enterprise databases supporting the State Portal Project. This role is suitable for experienced professionals who can independently manage production databases, ensure high availability, optimize database performance, and maintain data integrity and security.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933836\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.1 Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong>Database Administration:</strong> Install, configure, administer, and maintain MySQL/PostgreSQL/MariaDB databases across development, testing, and production environments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span><strong>Database Performance &amp; Optimization:</strong> Monitor database performance, optimize queries, indexes, stored procedures, and database structures to ensure efficient system performance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong>Backup &amp; Recovery:</strong> Plan, implement, monitor, and periodically test database backup, restoration, disaster recovery, and business continuity procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Security:</strong> Implement database security measures including user access control, privilege management, encryption, auditing, and compliance with security best practices.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Monitoring &amp; Troubleshooting:</strong> Monitor database health, identify performance bottlenecks, troubleshoot database-related issues, and ensure maximum uptime.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><strong>Database Migration &amp; Deployment:</strong> Perform database installation, migration, upgrades, patch management, replication setup, and deployment activities with minimal downtime.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain database architecture documents, configuration details, backup procedures, recovery plans, and operational documentation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with application developers, system administrators, DevOps engineers, and project managers for database design, deployment, and support.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l7 level1 lfo2;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Ensure data integrity, database availability, and compliance with organizational policies and Government security standards.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933837\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.2 Requirements</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, MCA, or related field.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minimum 6 years of professional experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp; </span></span></span>Strong knowledge of <strong>MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL, PL/SQL, database design, indexing, query optimization, replication, backup &amp; recovery, performance tuning, and database security</strong><strong>.</strong></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience in database installation, configuration, migration, clustering, high availability, and disaster recovery solutions.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Ability to work independently and manage enterprise database environments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span>The candidate will not be required to work exclusively on a single database platform; however, basic knowledge of other database technologies and readiness to learn emerging database platforms as per project requirements is essential.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>The candidate should also have working knowledge of server-related activities including database deployment, configuration, monitoring, and troubleshooting.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l5 level1 lfo3;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference will be given to experienced candidates who have worked in Government Organizations.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933838\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.3 Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Familiarity with cloud database platforms and containerization technologies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Knowledge of Linux/Windows server administration and database deployment environments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience with Git, GitLab, Bitbucket, and database automation tools.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of High Availability, replication, clustering, and disaster recovery architecture.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo4;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933839\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt;\">3.2 Graphic Designer&ndash;Level 6</span></strong></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">The <strong>Graphic Designer</strong> will be <a name=\"_Toc234933843\"></a>responsible for creating intuitive, user-centered design solutions that enhance the usability and user experience of web and mobile applications. The role involves collaborating closely with UI designers, developers, project managers, and stakeholders to gather requirements, conduct user research, and translate insights into wireframes, prototypes, and user flows.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\">The ideal candidate is creative, detail-oriented, and passionate about improving user experience through thoughtful design and usability practices.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092065\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.6.1 Key Responsibilities</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>User Research</strong>: Conduct user research, interviews, surveys, and usability tests to understand user needs and behaviours.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Wire framing &amp; Prototyping</strong>: Create wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes using tools like Figma, Adobe XD, or Sketch.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>User Journey Mapping</strong>: Develop user personas, journey maps, and user flows to guide design decisions.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Collaboration</strong>: Work closely with UI designers, developers, and project teams to ensure seamless user experience integration.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Feedback &amp; Testing</strong>: Incorporate feedback from stakeholders and users to refine designs; conduct A/B testing where applicable.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l2 level1 lfo7; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Design Documentation</strong>: Prepare design specifications and documentation to support development teams.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092066\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.6.2 Requirements</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>Bachelor\'s or Master&rsquo;s Degree in Computer Science<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>or<span style=\"mso-spacerun: yes;\">&nbsp; </span>Bacorhelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree in Design, Computer Science, or a related field.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->5 years of experience in UX/UI design or a similar role.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoBodyText\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-pagination: none; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt; text-autospace: none; margin: 3.45pt 5.85pt .0001pt 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Preference<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>will<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>be<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>given<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>to<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>experienced<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>candidates<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>of<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>work in Govt.<span style=\"letter-spacing: .05pt;\"> </span>Organization.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Proficient in UX/UI tools such as Figma, Adobe XD, Sketch, InVision, or Balsamiq.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of design principles, responsive design, accessibility, and user-centered methodologies.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l8 level1 lfo8; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Familiarity with HTML/CSS is a plus (for effective developer communication).</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092067\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.6.3 Desirable</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Basic understanding of UX/UI design and visual design principles.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience working on government, enterprise, or public-facing applications.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"margin-left: 36.0pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo9; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-size: 10.0pt; mso-bidi-font-size: 12.0pt; font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong communication and presentation skills in<strong> </strong>English and Hindi.</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">&nbsp;</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">3.3 Assistant Manager &ndash; Level 4</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Assistant Manager will be responsible for assisting in the overall coordination, monitoring, documentation, and administrative management of the State Portal Project. The role involves maintaining project records and files, preparing official correspondence and reports, monitoring project progress, and ensuring timely execution of project activities in accordance with Government procedures. This role is suitable for experienced professionals who can independently handle project coordination, documentation, stakeholder communication, and administrative functions while supporting the successful implementation of the State Portal Project.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933844\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.1 Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;</span></span></span><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement of the State Portal.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><strong>File Management:</strong> Process and maintain project files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and related documentation in accordance with Government procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain DPRs, TORs, proposals, meeting minutes, technical notes, project reports, presentations, utilization reports, and other project-related documents.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span><strong>Administrative Support:</strong> Assist in processing administrative and financial proposals, manpower deployment, contract-related documents, and other official matters pertaining to the project.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong> Monitor project progress, timelines, milestones, resource deployment, and deliverables, and prepare periodic progress reports for higher authorities.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Compliance:</strong> Ensure project documentation and activities comply with Government rules, departmental guidelines and applicable standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Meeting Coordination:</strong> Organize meetings, prepare agendas, record minutes of meetings (MoMs), and follow up on action points.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l6 level1 lfo5;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Support to Management:</strong> Provide administrative and coordination support to senior officers in project planning, review meetings, and decision-making processes.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933845\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.2 Requirements</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; </span></span></span>Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree in Engineering (B.E./B.Tech.) in any discipline, MBA, Management, or any other equivalent professional qualification from a recognized University/Institution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minimum<strong> </strong>4 years of professional experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Experience in project coordination, Government correspondence, file processing, documentation, report preparation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>Working knowledge of MS Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), project documentation, and office management practices.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</span></span></span>Ability to independently handle official correspondence, prepare reports, maintain project records, and coordinate with team.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></span></span>Basic understanding of e-Governance projects, website management will be preferred.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l4 level1 lfo6;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"> &nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span>Preference will be given to candidates having experience of working in Government Organizations or Government IT/e-Governance projects.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933846\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.3 Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Experience in handling Government files, official noting and drafting, DPR preparation, and procurement-related documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Knowledge of Government administrative procedures, project monitoring.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Familiarity with project management and documentation tools.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Understanding of e-Governance initiatives and digital service delivery frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 115%; mso-list: l3 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: list 36.0pt;\">Strong communication, drafting, presentation, and interpersonal skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul> to <h1 style=\"margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933835\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt;\">3.1 Database Admin &ndash;Level 7</span></strong></h1>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The <strong>Database Administrator (DBA)</strong> will be responsible for the installation, configuration, administration, monitoring, performance optimization, backup, recovery, security, and maintenance of enterprise databases supporting the State Portal Project. This role is suitable for experienced professionals who can independently manage production databases, ensure high availability, optimize database performance, and maintain data integrity and security.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933836\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.1 Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li><strong>Database Administration:</strong>&nbsp;Install, configure, administer, and maintain MySQL/PostgreSQL/MariaDB databases&nbsp;across development, testing, and production environments.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Performance &amp; Optimization:</strong> Monitor database performance, optimize queries, indexes, stored procedures, and&nbsp;database structures to&nbsp;ensure efficient system&nbsp;performance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Backup &amp; Recovery:</strong> Plan, implement, monitor, and&nbsp;periodically test database&nbsp;backup, restoration, disaster&nbsp;recovery, and business&nbsp;continuity procedures.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database&nbsp;Security:</strong> Implement database&nbsp;security measures including&nbsp;user access control, privilege management,&nbsp;encryption, auditing, and&nbsp;compliance with security&nbsp;best practices.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Monitoring &amp; Troubleshooting:</strong> Monitor database health, identify performance bottlenecks, troubleshoot database-related issues, and&nbsp;ensure maximum uptime.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Migration &amp; Deployment:</strong> Perform database installation, migration, upgrades, patch&nbsp;management, replication setup, and&nbsp;deployment activities with&nbsp;minimal downtime.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation: </strong>Prepare and&nbsp;maintain database architecture&nbsp;documents, configuration&nbsp;details, backup procedures, recovery plans, and&nbsp;operational documentation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Work closely&nbsp;with application developers, system administrators,&nbsp;DevOps engineers, and&nbsp;project managers for&nbsp;database design, deployment, and support.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Ensure data integrity, database availability, and compliance with organizational policies and Government security standards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933837\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.2 Requirements</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree&nbsp;in Computer Science, Information Technology, MCA, or related&nbsp;field.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 6 years&nbsp;of professional experience.</li>\r\n<li>Strong knowledge of&nbsp;MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL, PL/SQL, database design, indexing, query optimization, replication, backup &amp; recovery, performance&nbsp;tuning, and database&nbsp;security.</li>\r\n<li>Experience in database&nbsp;installation, configuration, migration, clustering,&nbsp;high availability, and&nbsp;disaster recovery solutions.</li>\r\n<li>Ability&nbsp;to work independently&nbsp;and manage enterprise&nbsp;database environments.</li>\r\n<li>The candidate will&nbsp;not be required&nbsp;to work exclusively&nbsp;on a single&nbsp;database platform; however, basic knowledge of&nbsp;other database technologies&nbsp;and readiness to&nbsp;learn emerging database&nbsp;platforms as per&nbsp;project requirements is&nbsp;essential.</li>\r\n<li>The candidate should&nbsp;also have working&nbsp;knowledge of server-related activities including&nbsp;database deployment, configuration, monitoring, and troubleshooting.</li>\r\n<li>Preference will be given to experienced candidates who have worked in Government Organizations.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933838\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.1.3 Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Familiarity with cloud&nbsp;database platforms&nbsp;and containerization technologies.</li>\r\n<li>Knowledge of Linux/Windows server administration&nbsp;and database deployment&nbsp;environments.</li>\r\n<li>Experience with Git, GitLab, Bitbucket, and&nbsp;database automation tools.</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of High&nbsp;Availability, replication, clustering, and disaster recovery&nbsp;architecture.</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies.</li>\r\n<li>Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h1 style=\"margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933839\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.5pt;\">3.2 Graphic Designer&ndash;Level 6</span></strong></h1>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The <strong>Graphic Designer</strong> will be&nbsp;responsible for creating intuitive, user-centered design solutions that enhance the usability and user experience of web and mobile applications. The role involves collaborating closely with UI designers, developers, project managers, and stakeholders to gather requirements, conduct user research, and translate insights into wireframes, prototypes, and user flows.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\">The ideal candidate is creative, detail-oriented, and passionate about improving user experience through thoughtful design and usability practices.</span></p>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092065\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.2.1 Key Responsibilities</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li><strong>User Research:</strong> Conduct&nbsp;user research, interviews, surveys, and usability&nbsp;tests&nbsp;to understand user&nbsp;needs and behaviours.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Wire framing &amp; Prototyping:</strong> Create wireframes, mockups, and interactive prototypes&nbsp;using tools like&nbsp;Figma, Adobe XD, or&nbsp;Sketch.</li>\r\n<li><strong>User Journey Mapping:</strong> Develop user personas, journey maps, and&nbsp;user flows to&nbsp;guide design decisions.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Work closely&nbsp;with UI designers, developers, and project&nbsp;teams to ensure&nbsp;seamless user experience&nbsp;integration.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Feedback &amp; Testing: </strong>Incorporate&nbsp;feedback from stakeholders&nbsp;and users to&nbsp;refine designs; conduct&nbsp;A/B testing&nbsp;where applicable.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Design Documentation: </strong>Prepare&nbsp;design specifications and&nbsp;documentation to support&nbsp;development teams.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092066\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.2.2 Requirements</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Bachelor\'s or Master&rsquo;s&nbsp;Degree in&nbsp;Computer Science or&nbsp;Bacorhelor&rsquo;s/Master&rsquo;s Degree&nbsp;in Design, Computer&nbsp;Science, or a&nbsp;related field.</li>\r\n<li>5 years&nbsp;of experience in&nbsp;UX/UI design&nbsp;or a similar&nbsp;role.</li>\r\n<li>Preference will be&nbsp;given to experienced&nbsp;candidates of work&nbsp;in Govt. Organization.</li>\r\n<li>Proficient in UX/UI tools such&nbsp;as Figma, Adobe&nbsp;XD, Sketch, InVision, or Balsamiq.</li>\r\n<li>Understanding&nbsp;of design principles, responsive design, accessibility, and user-centered&nbsp;methodologies.</li>\r\n<li>Familiarity with HTML/CSS is a&nbsp;plus (for effective&nbsp;developer communication).</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><a name=\"_Toc195092067\"></a><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.2.3 Desirable</span></strong></span></h3>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Basic understanding of&nbsp;UX/UI design and&nbsp;visual design principles.</li>\r\n<li>Experience working on&nbsp;government, enterprise, or public-facing applications.</li>\r\n<li>Strong communication and presentation skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\"><span style=\"mso-bookmark: _Toc234933843;\"><strong><span style=\"font-size: 13.5pt;\">3.3 Assistant Manager &ndash; Level 4</span></strong></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"isselectedend\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">The Assistant Manager will be responsible for assisting in the overall coordination, monitoring, documentation, and administrative management of the State Portal Project. The role involves maintaining project records and files, preparing official correspondence and reports, monitoring project progress, and ensuring timely execution of project activities in accordance with Government procedures. This role is suitable for experienced professionals who can independently handle project coordination, documentation, stakeholder communication, and administrative functions while supporting the successful implementation of the State Portal Project.</p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933844\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.1 Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li><strong>Project Coordination:</strong> Coordinate&nbsp;with Government Departments, District Administrations, vendors, and technical&nbsp;teams for implementation, maintenance, and enhancement&nbsp;of the State&nbsp;Portal.</li>\r\n<li><strong>File Management:</strong> Process&nbsp;and maintain project&nbsp;files, official records, correspondence, approvals, office notes, and&nbsp;related documentation in&nbsp;accordance with Government&nbsp;procedures.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and&nbsp;maintain DPRs, TORs, proposals, meeting minutes, technical notes, project&nbsp;reports, presentations,&nbsp;utilization reports, and&nbsp;other project-related&nbsp;documents.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Administrative Support:</strong>&nbsp;Assist in processing&nbsp;administrative and financial&nbsp;proposals, manpower deployment, contract-related documents, and other official&nbsp;matters pertaining to&nbsp;the project.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Monitoring &amp; Reporting:</strong>&nbsp;Monitor project progress, timelines, milestones,&nbsp;resource&nbsp;deployment, and deliverables, and prepare periodic&nbsp;progress reports for&nbsp;higher authorities.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Compliance:</strong> Ensure project&nbsp;documentation and activities&nbsp;comply with Government&nbsp;rules, departmental guidelines&nbsp;and applicable standards.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Meeting Coordination:</strong> Organize&nbsp;meetings, prepare agendas, record minutes of&nbsp;meetings (MoMs), and follow&nbsp;up on action&nbsp;points.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Support to Management:</strong> Provide administrative and coordination support to senior officers in project planning, review meetings, and decision-making processes.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933845\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.2 Requirements</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree&nbsp;in Engineering (B.E./B.Tech.) in&nbsp;any discipline, MBA, Management, or any&nbsp;other&nbsp;equivalent professional&nbsp;qualification from a&nbsp;recognized University/Institution.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum 4 years&nbsp;of professional experience.</li>\r\n<li>Experience in project&nbsp;coordination, Government&nbsp;correspondence, file processing, documentation, report&nbsp;preparation.</li>\r\n<li>Working knowledge of&nbsp;MS Office (Word, Excel, PowerPoint), project&nbsp;documentation, and office&nbsp;management practices.</li>\r\n<li>Ability&nbsp;to independently handle&nbsp;official correspondence, prepare reports, maintain&nbsp;project records, and&nbsp;coordinate with team.</li>\r\n<li>Basic understanding of&nbsp;e-Governance projects, website management will&nbsp;be preferred.</li>\r\n<li>Preference will be given to candidates having experience of working in Government Organizations or Government IT/e-Governance projects.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933846\"></a><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">3.3.3 Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul style=\"margin-top: 0cm;\" type=\"disc\">\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Experience in handling Government files, official noting and drafting, DPR preparation, and procurement-related documentation.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Knowledge of Government administrative procedures, project monitoring.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Familiarity with project management and documentation tools.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Understanding of e-Governance initiatives and digital service delivery frameworks.</li>\r\n<li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: 1.5;\">Strong communication, drafting, presentation, and interpersonal skills in English and Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul><br>Special condition changed from <h3 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.1pt; line-height: 15.3pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 23.65pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 23.6pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933848\"></a><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; position: relative; top: -.5pt; mso-text-raise: .5pt; mso-font-width: 109%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><u><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Resource Replacement<br><br></span></u></strong></h3>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 5.75pt .0001pt 21.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The selected agency needs to give 1 (One) Month of advance notice to CHiPS for any change of deployed resource during the course of the assignment.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 5.75pt .0001pt 21.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The selected agency needs to ensure knowledge transfer and handover during change of any resource for smooth transition.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -14.2pt; line-height: 115%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; margin: 0cm 5.75pt .0001pt 21.3pt;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->The replacement of any resource should be approved by <span style=\"letter-spacing: .1pt;\">CHiPS.</span></p> to <h3 style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.1pt; line-height: 15.3pt; mso-line-height-rule: exactly; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; tab-stops: 23.65pt; margin: 0cm 0cm .0001pt 23.6pt;\"><a name=\"_Toc234933848\"></a><!-- [if !supportLists]--><strong><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; position: relative; top: -.5pt; mso-text-raise: .5pt; mso-font-width: 109%; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;</span></span></span></strong><!--[endif]--><strong><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-width: 105%;\">Resource Replacement</span><u><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt; mso-font-width: 105%;\"><br></span></u></strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>The selected agency&nbsp;needs to give&nbsp;1 (One) Month of advance&nbsp;notice to CHiPS&nbsp;for any change&nbsp;of deployed resource&nbsp;during the course&nbsp;of the assignment.</li>\r\n<li>The selected agency&nbsp;needs to ensure&nbsp;knowledge&nbsp;transfer and handover&nbsp;during change of&nbsp;any resource for&nbsp;smooth transition.</li>\r\n<li>The replacement of any resource should be approved by CHiPS.</li>\r\n</ul><br>', '2026-09-11 10:28:24', 60, 1, '2026-09-11 10:36:30', 1);
INSERT INTO `log_eoi_updates` (`recordid`, `requestid`, `particular`, `updatedon`, `updatedby`, `isviewed`, `viewedon`, `viewedby`) VALUES
(267, 182, 'The following details were updated for the resource <br>Qualification changed from <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree in Computer Science, Information Technology, MCA, or related field from a recognized University/Institution.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Minimum <strong>6 years</strong> of professional experience.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">&middot;<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\"> Strong knowledge of MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL, PL/SQL, database design, indexing, query optimization, replication, backup &amp; recovery, performance tuning and database security. </span></span></span></span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"text-align: justify; text-indent: -18pt;\"><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\"><span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 11.0pt; line-height: 115%; font-family: \'Calibri\',sans-serif; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-fareast-font-family: Calibri; mso-fareast-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Mangal; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi; mso-ansi-language: EN-US; mso-fareast-language: EN-US; mso-bidi-language: AR-SA;\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;Experience in database installation, configuration, migration, clustering, high availability and disaster recovery solutions.</span></span></span></span></li>\r\n</ul> to <ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Bachelor\'s/Master\'s degree&nbsp;in Computer Science, Information Technology, MCA, or related&nbsp;field from a&nbsp;recognized&nbsp;University/Institution.</li>\r\n<li>Minimum <strong>6 years</strong>&nbsp;of professional experience.</li>\r\n<li>Strong knowledge of&nbsp;MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, SQL, PL/SQL, database design, indexing, query optimization, replication, backup &amp;&nbsp;recovery, performance tuning&nbsp;and database security.</li>\r\n<li>Experience in database&nbsp;installation, configuration, migration, clustering,&nbsp;high availability and&nbsp;disaster recovery solutions.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>Remark changed from <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">    </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Administration:</strong> Install, configure, administer, and maintain MySQL/PostgreSQL/MariaDB databases across development, testing, and production environments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Performance & Optimization:</strong> Monitor database performance, optimize queries, indexes, stored procedures, and database structures to ensure efficient system performance.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Backup & Recovery:</strong> Plan, implement, monitor, and periodically test database backup, restoration, disaster recovery, and business continuity procedures.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Security:</strong> Implement database security measures including user access control, privilege management, encryption, auditing, and compliance with security best practices.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Monitoring & Troubleshooting:</strong> Monitor database health, identify performance bottlenecks, troubleshoot database-related issues, and ensure maximum uptime.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Database Migration & Deployment:</strong> Perform database installation, migration, upgrades, patch management, replication setup, and deployment activities with minimal downtime.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">     </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and maintain database architecture documents, configuration details, backup procedures, recovery plans, and operational documentation.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Collaboration:</strong> Work closely with application developers, system administrators, DevOps engineers, and project managers for database design, deployment, and support.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><strong>Security & Compliance:</strong> Ensure data integrity, database availability, and compliance with organizational policies and Government security standards.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-align: justify; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"> </p>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Familiarity with cloud database platforms and containerization technologies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Knowledge of Linux/Windows server administration and database deployment environments.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Experience with Git, GitLab, Bitbucket, and database automation tools.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of High Availability, replication, clustering, and disaster recovery architecture.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies.</p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"mso-margin-top-alt: auto; mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; margin-left: 35.45pt; text-indent: -18.0pt; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1;\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\"font-family: Symbol; mso-fareast-font-family: Symbol; mso-bidi-font-family: Symbol;\"><span style=\"mso-list: Ignore;\">·<span style=\"font: 7.0pt \'Times New Roman\';\">       </span></span></span><!--[endif]-->Strong communication skills in English and Hindi.</p> to <h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Key Responsibilities</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li><strong>Database Administration:</strong>&nbsp;Install, configure, administer, and&nbsp;maintain MySQL/PostgreSQL/MariaDB databases across&nbsp;development, testing, and&nbsp;production environments.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Performance &amp; Optimization:</strong> Monitor database performance, optimize queries, indexes, stored procedures, and database structures&nbsp;to ensure efficient&nbsp;system performance.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Backup &amp; Recovery: </strong>Plan, implement, monitor, and&nbsp;periodically test database&nbsp;backup, restoration, disaster&nbsp;recovery, and business&nbsp;continuity procedures.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Security:</strong> Implement&nbsp;database security measures&nbsp;including user access&nbsp;control, privilege management, encryption, auditing,&nbsp;and&nbsp;compliance with security&nbsp;best practices.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Monitoring &amp; Troubleshooting:</strong> Monitor database health, identify performance bottlenecks, troubleshoot database-related issues, and&nbsp;ensure maximum uptime.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Database Migration &amp; Deployment: </strong>Perform database installation, migration, upgrades, patch&nbsp;management, replication&nbsp;setup, and deployment&nbsp;activities with minimal&nbsp;downtime.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Prepare and&nbsp;maintain database architecture&nbsp;documents, configuration&nbsp;details, backup procedures, recovery plans, and&nbsp;operational documentation.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Collaboration: </strong>Work closely&nbsp;with application developers, system administrators,&nbsp;DevOps engineers, and&nbsp;project managers for&nbsp;database design, deployment, and support.</li>\r\n<li><strong>Security &amp; Compliance:</strong> Ensure data integrity, database availability, and compliance with organizational policies and Government security standards.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 style=\"text-indent: 0cm; line-height: normal; margin: 10.4pt 0cm .0001pt 0cm;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\">Desirable</span></h2>\r\n<ul data-assistant-stream-block=\"\" data-assistant-stream-block-index=\"0\">\r\n<li>Familiarity with cloud&nbsp;database&nbsp;platforms and containerization&nbsp;technologies.</li>\r\n<li>Knowledge of Linux/Windows server administration&nbsp;and database deployment&nbsp;environments.</li>\r\n<li>Experience with Git, GitLab, Bitbucket, and&nbsp;database automation tools.</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of High&nbsp;Availability, replication, clustering, and disaster recovery&nbsp;architecture.</li>\r\n<li>Understanding of Agile/Scrum methodologies.</li>\r\n<li>Strong communication skills&nbsp;in English and&nbsp;Hindi.</li>\r\n</ul>.<br>on 11-09-2026, 10:31 AM', '2026-09-11 10:31:08', 60, 1, '2026-09-11 10:36:16', 1),
